ssion for business education.</p>\r\n', '<p>bachelor of commerce, commerce courses, master of commerce, bcom courses, bachelor of commerce online, bcom subjects, online bcom, online bcom course, courses for commerce students, after graduation courses in commerce, bcom admission, mcom admission, bcom course details, courses after bcom, bcom university, online courses for commerce students, after 12 commerce courses, bcom colleges near me, bachelor of commerce accounting, b commerce, commerce university, bachelor of commerce subjects, online courses for bcom students, study commerce, study bcom online, bcom general, university for commerce students, courses to do after bcom, commerce graduation courses, bcom courses list, bcom course fees, commerce courses list, bcom admission fees, bcomm online, courses for bcom students, colleges for bcom near me, mcom colleges near me, apply for bcom, bcom related courses, mcom course duration, online certificate course for commerce students, commerce all courses list, courses for commerce students after graduation</p>\r\n', '<p>Faculty of Commerce - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:51:00', '2025-06-28 08:06:32', NULL, NULL),
(5, '5', 'FMA', 'INSTITUTE OF MANAGEMENT', '', 'faculty-of-management', 'The management program at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) is known for its innovative curriculum that blends theory and practice to help students develop a well-rounded understanding of the business world. With courses that cover everything from accounting and economics to organizational behavior and strategy, students in this program gain a broad range of skills and knowledge that they can apply to a variety of career paths. What\'s more, the college has strong ties to the local business community, giving students ample opportunities to learn from and network with industry leaders. here students will also get research opportunities , study abroad programs. Whether you are looking to launch your own startup or climb the corporate ladder, the management program at GMIU provides you with the education, experience, and connections you need to achieve your goals.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The management program at Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU) is known for its innovative curriculum that blends theory and practice to help students develop a well-rounded understanding of the business world. With courses that cover everything from accounting and economics to organizational behavior and strategy, students in this program gain a broad range of skills and knowledge that they can apply to a variety of career paths. What&#39;s more, the college has strong ties to the local business community, giving students ample opportunities to learn from and network with industry leaders. here students will also get research opportunities , study abroad programs. Whether you are looking to launch your own startup or climb the corporate ladder, the management program at GMIU provides you with the education, experience, and connections you need to achieve your goals.</span></p>\r\n', 'Meet GMIU faculty—learn about their qualifications, expertise, and role in fostering an enriching academic environment for student success.', 'bba course, bba course details, bba course fees, bba subjects, mba courses list, mba course, mba fees, mba university, mba in digital marketing, mba course details, mba in management, school for business management, business colleges, mba study, mba in marketing, mba course fees, mba subjects, mba degree, bba admission, bba online, bba program, mba studies, mba in education, bba fees, mba management courses, mba institute, online mba it management, bba course duration, local mba programs, mba brochure, admission for mba, mba information, mba programmes', 'Faculty of Management - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:52:09', '2025-06-27 10:39:49', NULL, NULL),
(6, '6', 'FAR', 'INSTITUTE OF ARTS', '', 'faculty-of-arts', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nowadays being a competitive era it is necessary to get good and quality education in this competitive era. Our curriculum is also innovative compared to other institutes to enhance the student&#39;s local and international opportunities. Along with the required study in the classroom by the expert faculty of Gnanmanjari, the university will coordinate with various corporate companies for placements and internships in different domains, research based projects, workshops for improving life and social skills, case studies and experiential learning. Also sent by college in institutions. Like BA in Psychology students will be sent to do psychological case studies of children in hospitals, prisons, schools for case studies of various branches of psychology like criminal psychology, social, counselling, behavioural, group etc. Evaluation will be done through seminars, debates by experts coming from corporate companies. The college will be guided by international level experts in subjects like international research. Gujarat government&#39;s I-hub, along with professional associations like CII provides startup information, study as well as government exam preparation and interview preparation is done under the GENIUS program. Students of general stream in the college can do multi-tasking project work with students of different faculties.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'Meet the faculty member at GMIU – learn about their qualifications, expertise, and dedication to delivering a high-quality academic experience for students.', 'university admission, university study, degree programs, faculty of arts, ba programs, ba university, activities for students, ma in administration, ma university, university for ba, college information, ba subject, university of arts, good universities, ba programme, bachelor of arts courses, ba admission fees, arts university, ba in administration, university study, master in arts, ba study, ba course fees, ba bachelor of arts, ba arts, faculty of arts, ba graduation, ba course subjects, admission ba, ba arts subjects', 'Faculty of Arts | Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:52:48', '2025-06-11 09:11:26', NULL, NULL),
