(8, '8', 'FCA', 'INSTITUTE OF COMPUTER APPLICATION (BCA &amp; MCA)', '', 'faculty-of-computer-application-bca-amp-mca-', 'In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like IOT, Data science, cloud technology.  The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers.  The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology.  With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like IOT, Data science, cloud technology. The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers. The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology. With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIU faculty profiles—learn about their qualifications, research interests, and dedication to academic growth and student success.', 'bca course, bca course fees, mca course, bca admission, online bca course, bca subjects, mca course fees, online bca, mca course duration, online mca, bca fees, mca online course, mca admission, online bca course fees, mca degree, bca degree, bca course information, mca online degree, bca course subjects, mca college, online bca degree, online mca degree, it degree courses, bca apply online, mca in data science, computer science degree courses, bca admission process, computer application course, bca computer course, mca online admission, computer science subjects, computing courses, mca data science, it course fees, bca university, online bca admission, bca course apply online, mca subjects, bca computer science, colleges for computer science near me', 'BCA & MCA Courses, Fees, Admission at Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:52:54', '2025-06-27 10:40:27', NULL, NULL),
(9, '9', 'FHE', 'INSTITUTE OF DESIGN', '', 'faculty-of-design', 'GMIU is benchmark GYANMANJARI INSTITUTE for design and research. We set to raise the bar of creative teaching in Gujarat. The GYANMANJARI INSTITUTE of Design provides four years Bachelors of Design Program with specialization in product, environment, communication & fashion design. The prime philosophy of GMIU is to provide an ideal and creative learning environment and to continue the tradition of excellence in the education of the sponsoring body of the University.', '<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">True design is what takes shape when&nbsp;<strong>function finds its beauty</strong>. We believe your unique design voice is born from your past&mdash;your upbringing and the environments that shaped you. At Gyanmanjari Institute of Design, we help you uncover that voice by teaching you to&nbsp;<strong>see, not just look</strong>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We encourage you to&nbsp;<strong>draw inspiration from everywhere</strong>, remixing the world&rsquo;s best ideas with your own perspective. By focusing on&nbsp;<strong>creative agency and rigorous process</strong>, we turn your raw intuition into professional skill. Here, you will learn that design is inside you; we simply provide the tools, technology, and mentorship to let it out.</span></p>\r\n', '<p>Meet the faculty at GMIU&mdash;explore their academic background, expertise, and dedication to delivering a rich, engaging learning experience for students.</p>\r\n', '<p>fashion designing course, fashion designing course fees, diploma in fashion designing, fashion designing courses after 12th, fashion designing course near me, fashion design online course, bachelor of fashion design, fashion designing, university of fashion, fashion course, diploma in fashion designing after 10th, interior design courses, fashion design university, fashion design online course with certificate, bachelor of design, fashion design certificate, college classes, online college courses, interior design diploma, interior design course near me, fashion design online, interior designing course fees, courses after 12th, designing courses after 12th, online fashion designing course with certificate, apply for university, interior design courses after 12th, design university, diploma courses, design courses, fashion technology course, study fashion, interior design study, fashion design certificate online, interior design diploma course, fashion designing courses after 12th fees, diploma fashion designing course, food technology course, fashion and design course</p>\r\n', '<p>Bachelor&#39;s of Fashion Designing Course | Fees | Gyanmanjari University</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:56:11', '2026-01-30 06:59:58', NULL, NULL),
(10, '10', 'FNC', 'Nursing', '', 'nursing', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2023-03-07 05:57:09', '2024-12-09 05:10:17', NULL, NULL),
(11, '11', 'FMH', 'INSTITUTE OF MEDICAL SCIENCE AND HEALTH CARE', '', 'faculty-of-medical-science-and-health-care', 'Medical science uses laboratory skills combined with clinical approaches to investigate the human body. It is the science behind health maintenance and disease prevention and treatment. Students might find themselves taking courses in molecular biology, nutrition, neuroscience, toxicology and the like in this broad field of study.  Health Care study deals with many of the issues faced by healthcare administrators. Studies cover health administration, pharmaceutical innovations, public interest programs, health communication, global health issues and telemedicine management.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Medical science uses laboratory skills combined with clinical approaches to investigate the human body. It is the science behind health maintenance and disease prevention and treatment. Students might find themselves taking courses in molecular biology, nutrition, neuroscience, toxicology and the like in this broad field of study. Health Care study deals with many of the issues faced by healthcare administrators. Studies cover health administration, pharmaceutical innovations, public interest programs, health communication, global health issues and telemedicine management.</span></p>\r\n', '<p>Explore GMIU faculty profiles&mdash;discover academic expertise, research interests, and contributions that enhance the student learning experience.</p>\r\n', '<p>Health Science Courses, Medical Courses, Diploma Of Health Science, College Online, Online Healthcare Programs, Online Universities, Public Health Courses, Universities In Usa, College Application, Us Colleges, University Courses, Degree Courses, Health Science Programs, Uni Courses, Health Science Online, Online Health Courses, Pg Diploma Courses, Online Health Programs, University Programs, Diploma Of Health Science Online, Diploma Of Health, Health Science Online Courses, American Universities, Health Care Programs Online, Diploma In Medical Laboratory Technology, Medical Technology Course, Public Health Course Requirements, Public Universities, Courses In Medical Field, University Global, Healthcare Administration Courses Near Me, Admission Science, Pharmacy Study, Medical Science Courses, Diploma Courses In Medical Field,Health Science Certificate, Diploma In Health Administration, Online University Biology, Home University, Management And Science University, Health Science Certificate Online, Health Diploma Courses, Medical Program Online, Application University, University On Line</p>\r\n', '<p>Faculty of Medical Science and Health Care at Gyanmanjari University</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2023-03-07 05:58:38', '2026-02-04 08:35:06', NULL, NULL),
(12, '12', 'FSW', 'INSTITUTE OF SOCIAL WORK', '', 'faculty-of-social-work', 'GNIU\'s social work program provides a comprehensive education that combines theoretical knowledge with practical experience. With expert faculty members and a challenging curriculum covering social welfare policy, human behavior and development, diversity and oppression, social work practice, research methods, and ethics, students are prepared to become skilled and compassionate professionals. The program offers ample opportunities for practical experience through internships, field placements, or supervised practice, in a variety of settings such as hospitals, schools, social service agencies, and government organizations. Graduates are well-prepared to pursue rewarding careers in social work and related fields, helping individuals, families, and communities overcome social, emotional, and behavioral challenges to make a positive impact on society.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">GMIU&#39;s social work program provides a comprehensive education that combines theoretical knowledge with practical experience. With expert faculty members and a challenging curriculum covering social welfare policy, human behavior and development, diversity and oppression, social work practice, research methods, and ethics, students are prepared to become skilled and compassionate professionals. The program offers ample opportunities for practical experience through internships, field placements, or supervised practice, in a variety of settings such as hospitals, schools, social service agencies, and government organizations. Graduates are well-prepared to pursue rewarding careers in social work and related fields, helping individuals, families, and communities overcome social, emotional, and behavioral challenges to make a positive impact on society.</span></p>\r\n', 'Meet the faculty at GMIU – Learn about the expertise, academic background, and contributions of our esteemed faculty member, enhancing the learning experience at GMIU.', 'Social Work Program, Social Work Schools Near Me, Schools For Social Work, Online Bsw, Social Worker Online Courses, Bachelor In Social Work Online, College Online, Online Universities, Social Work Course, Online Social Work Program, Universities In Usa, Social Work Masters Programs, Us Colleges, College Application, Master\'s Degree In Social Work Online, Master In Social Work, Online Social Work Masters Programs, Bachelor Of Science In Social Work, Msw Schools, Social Work Schooling, Online Social Work Degree Programs, Colleges For Social Work Near Me, Online Master\'s In Social Work, Social Work, Online Msw Program, Online Bsw Program, Online Social Worker, Bachelor Degree Programs, Online University For Social Work, Bachelor Of Social Work, Bsw Social Work, Social Work University, Online Schools For Bachelor\'s Degree In Social Work, Become A Social Worker, Msw Program, Social Work Bsw Online, Undergraduate Degree, Social Work Program Near Me, Master In Education, Becoming A Social Worker Online, Masters Degrees In Social Work, Apply University, Social Work Msw, Schools To Become A Social Worker, Social Worker Education Requirements, Social Worker Education, Online Schools For Education, American Universities, Master\'s Program Social Work, Online Master In Education, University Post', 'Faculty of Social Work at Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 0, 0, '2023-03-07 05:59:51', '2025-06-11 09:11:26', NULL, NULL),
