(25, NULL, 'FL', 'Faculty of Law', '', 'faculty-of-law', '', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, you embark on a journey through a dynamic and multifaceted legal landscape. With your degree, you are equipped to explore different career paths, from practicing as a lawyer in court to working in corporate law, legal consulting, academia or even public service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The Indian legal system offers a wide range of opportunities. You can choose to specialize in areas such as constitutional law, criminal law, corporate law, intellectual property, environmental law or human rights. Additionally, the growing demand for legal professionals in the corporate sector is opening doors to corporate counsel positions, where you can advise businesses on regulatory compliance, contracts, and other legal matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Beyond traditional roles, your legal education also prepares you for alternative careers in legal journalism, policy analysis, and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs) focused on advocacy and social justice. Additionally, you have the opportunity to pursue your studies or practice law in other common law jurisdictions around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;By entering the professional world, you will have the chance to contribute to the rule of law, uphold justice and have a significant impact on society. Whether you choose to practice in court, advise on a board of directors or engage in public service, your legal training provides a solid foundation for a rewarding and impactful career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', '', '', '', 1, 1, '2024-08-30 07:12:36', '2024-12-09 05:10:17', NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, 'FL', 'INSTITUTE OF LAW', '', 'faculty-of-law', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University, you embark on a journey through a dynamic and multifaceted legal landscape. With your degree, you are equipped to explore different career paths, from practicing as a lawyer in court to working in corporate law, legal consulting, academia or even public service.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">The Indian legal system offers a wide range of opportunities. You can choose to specialize in areas such as constitutional law, criminal law, corporate law, intellectual property, environmental law or human rights. Additionally, the growing demand for legal professionals in the corporate sector is opening doors to corporate counsel positions, where you can advise businesses on regulatory compliance, contracts, and other legal matters.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Beyond traditional roles, your legal education also prepares you for alternative careers in legal journalism, policy analysis, and nongovernmental organizations (NGOs) focused on advocacy and social justice. Additionally, you have the opportunity to pursue your studies or practice law in other common law jurisdictions around the world.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">By entering the professional world, you will have the chance to contribute to the rule of law, uphold justice and have a significant impact on society. Whether you choose to practice in court, advise on a board of directors or engage in public service, your legal training provides a solid foundation for a rewarding and impactful career.</span></span></p>\r\n', '<p>Discover GMIU&rsquo;s esteemed faculty committed to delivering quality education and mentorship, supporting students&rsquo; academic and professional growth.</p>\r\n', '<p>law course, university admission, ba llb course, llb admission, ba llb, llb degree, university of law, llb law, law university, bachelors degree in law, university of law courses, bachelors in law, the law university, university of law application, llb degree online, llb law degree, university of law apply, law studies, law admission, law education, llb admission process, law degree university, educational law degree, llb fees, law course after graduation, university of law llb, careers in law, law degree course, law at university, foundation law degree, law admission process, llb admission fees, law studies degree</p>\r\n', '<p>LLB &amp; Law Courses at GMIU | LLB Admission</p>\r\n', 1, 0, '2024-08-30 07:52:18', '2025-11-18 05:34:50', NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'GGC', 'Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', 'gyanmanjari-arts-commerce-girls-college', '', '<p>Nowadays being a competitive era it is necessary to get good and quality education in this competitive era. Our curriculum is also innovative compared to other institutes to enhance the student&#39;s local and international opportunities. Along with the required study in the classroom by the expert faculty of Gnanmanjari, the university will coordinate with various corporate companies for placements and internships in different domains, research based projects, workshops for improving life and social skills, case studies and experiential learning. Also sent by college in institutions. Evaluation will be done through seminars, debates by experts coming from corporate companies. The college will be guided by international level experts in subjects like international research. Gujarat government&#39;s I-hub, along with professional associations like CII provides startup information, study as well as government exam preparation and interview preparation is done under the GENIUS program. Students of general stream in the college can do multi-tasking project work with students of different faculties.</p>\r\n', 'Apply to GMIU’s Commerce programs—BCom, MCom, and online BCom—ideal for aspiring students seeking comprehensive commerce education and career growth.', 'College Application, Arts University, Education Study, Faculty In University, Bachelor Of Commerce, Commerce Courses, Master Of Commerce, Bcom Courses, Bachelor Of Commerce Online, Bcom Subjects, Online Bcom, Online Bcom Course, Courses For Commerce Students, After Graduation Courses In Commerce, Bcom Admission, Mcom Admission, Bcom Course Details, Courses After Bcom, Bcom University, Online Courses For Commerce Students, After 12 Commerce Courses, Bcom Colleges Near Me, Bachelor Of Commerce Accounting, B Commerce, Commerce University, Bachelor Of Commerce Subjects, Online Courses For Bcom Students, Study Commerce, University Admission, University Study, Degree Programs, Faculty Of Arts, Ba Programs, Ba University, Activities For Students, Ma In Administration, Ma University, University For Ba, College Information, Ba Subject, University Of Arts, Good Universities, Ba Programme, Bachelor Of Arts Courses, Ba Admission Fees, Arts University, Ba In Administration, University Study, Master In Arts, Ba Study, Ba Course Fees, Ba Bachelor Of Arts, Ba Arts, Faculty Of Arts', 'Gyanmanjari Arts/Commerce Girls College | Empowering Women Students', 1, 0, '2024-10-15 07:13:18', '2025-06-27 11:23:01', NULL, NULL),
