(38, 'G43', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Chemistry', 'under-graduation-b-sc-chemistry', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Chemistry is the scientiic discipline involved with elements and compounds&nbsp;&nbsp;composed of atoms, molecules and ions: their composition, structure, properties,&nbsp;&nbsp;behavior and the changes they undergo during a reaction with other substances.&nbsp;&nbsp;Chemistry occupies an intermediate position between physics andbiology.&nbsp;&nbsp;For example, chemistry explains aspects of plant chemistry(botany), how&nbsp;&nbsp;atmospheric ozone is formed and howenvironmental pollutants are degraded&nbsp;&nbsp;(ecology), the propertiesof the soil on the moon (astrophysics), how medications&nbsp;&nbsp;work(pharmacology), and how to collect DNA evidence at a crimescene&nbsp;&nbsp;(forensics).&nbsp;Chemistry addresses topics such as how atoms and moleculesinteract via&nbsp;chemical bonds to form new chemical compounds.&nbsp;&nbsp;Chemistry is typically divided into several major sub-disciplines. There are also&nbsp;&nbsp;several main cross-disciplinary and morespecialized fields of chemistry.</span></p>\r\n', 'Study B.Sc Chemistry with a focus on organic, inorganic, and physical chemistry. Build a foundation for careers in research or industry.', 'B.Sc Chemistry, undergraduate chemistry, chemistry degree, organic chemistry, analytical chemistry, Institute of Science, top science college in Gujarat', 'Participate in GMIU’s industry visit program for hands-on experience and valuable industry insights, guided by expert faculty to enhance your academic journey.', 'B.Sc in Chemistry – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'CHEM.', '3', 60, '4', 51900, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(39, 'G44', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Chemistry Hon. in Industrial Chemistry', 'under-graduation-b-sc-chemistry-hon-in-industrial-chemistry', 'A Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) honors degree in Industry Chemistry is an undergraduate program that focuses on the application of chemistry to industrial processes. This programme is 3 years in which students get more credit than regular courses.  The goal of the program is to provide students with a solid foundation in chemistry as well as the practical skills needed to work in the chemical industry. Graduates of the program are well-equipped to work in a variety of industries, including chemical manufacturing, pharmaceuticals, petrochemicals, and biotechnology. Throughout the program, students will also gain practical experience through laboratory work, research projects, and internships. This hands-on experience is essential for developing the skills needed to work in the chemical industry. Graduates of the program may work in a variety of roles, including research and development, process engineering, quality control, and environmental management. ', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) honors degree in Industry Chemistry is an undergraduate program that focuses on the application of chemistry to industrial processes. This programme is 4 years in which students get more credit than regular courses. The goal of the program is to provide students with a solid foundation in chemistry as well as the practical skills needed to work in the chemical industry. Graduates of the program are well-equipped to work in a variety of industries, including chemical manufacturing, pharmaceuticals, petrochemicals, and biotechnology. Throughout the program, students will also gain practical experience through laboratory work, research projects, and internships. This hands-on experience is essential for developing the skills needed to work in the chemical industry. Graduates of the program may work in a variety of roles, including research and development, process engineering, quality control, and environmental management.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore industrial chemistry through a B.Sc honors program. Learn applied chemical processes for pharmaceutical and manufacturing sectors.', 'industrial chemistry, chemistry honors, B.Sc industrial chemistry, applied chemistry, chemistry degree Gujarat, Institute of Science, top B.Sc college', 'Join GMIU\'s industry visit program to gain practical insights and real-world experience. This program enhances students\' knowledge and prepares them for success in their careers.', 'B.Sc Chemistry (Hons) in Industrial Chemistry – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'B.sc. Ind. chem. hon.', '3', 30, '4', 51900, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 45500, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(40, '', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc. Microbiology', 'under-graduation-b-sc-microbiology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">B.Sc.microbiology is an degree that is&nbsp;&nbsp;awarded to a candidate after the completion of&nbsp;&nbsp;the course. This course is not just limited to&nbsp;career but has huge expertise in the field of&nbsp;microbiology. Students who have completed&nbsp;10+2 in the relevant field of science are eligible&nbsp;to apply for this course. Students of this subject&nbsp;as a major can start a career in government&nbsp;based enterprise and research institutes or&nbsp;biotech-related companies such as food&nbsp;processing and pharmaceutical industry.&nbsp; Microbiology is a broad discipline that involves a study of the classification of microorganisms, ecology, cell biology, applications in agriculture food and medicine, biology of bacteria, viruses, protozoa and fungi. The main focus of the course is the pathogenic potential of the organisms that cause disease in man. The course also covers aspects of the biochemistry, physiology and genetics of microorganisms.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover microorganisms and their impact with our B.Sc Microbiology program. Ideal for careers in biotech, pharma, and research labs.', 'B.Sc Microbiology, microbiology degree, biotech course, microbiology college Gujarat, Institute of Science, undergraduate biology courses', 'Discover the industry visit program at GMIU, where students engage with professionals, explore real-world applications, and enhance their learning experience.', 'B.Sc in Microbiology – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'B.sc. Micro.', '3', 60, '4', 51900, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2026-01-19 10:09:26', 0, 0),
(41, '', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Micro Hon. In Biochemistry', 'under-graduation-b-sc-micro-hon-in-biochemistry', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">An Honor in Biochemistry is an undergraduate degree program that focuses on the study of the chemical processes and molecular interactions that occur within living organisms. This program is typically designed to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of the biochemical and molecular basis of life. Honors in Biochemistry degree can lead to a wide range of career opportunities in the fields of healthcare, biotechnology, pharmaceuticals, and research. Graduatesmay work as biochemists, research scientists, laboratory technicians, healthcare professionals or educators.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Gain expertise in biochemistry with an honors degree in microbiology. Study biomolecules, metabolism, and disease mechanisms.', 'biochemistry degree, microbiology honors, B.Sc biochemistry, molecular biology, Institute of Science, top science college', '', 'B.Sc Microbiology (Hons) in Biochemistry – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'B.sc. Hon  BioChem', '3', 30, '4', 59500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 12000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(42, '', 0, 3, 1, 'Hon. In BioTechnology', 'under-graduation-hon-in-biotechnology', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Hon BT', '3', 30, '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 45500, 0, 11000, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 1, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(43, 'G48', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Micro Hon in Food Technology', 'under-graduation-b-sc-micro-hon-in-food-technology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">A Bachelor of Science (B.Sc) in Microbiology with honors in Food Technology is an undergraduate degree program that combines the study of microbiology with the principles of food science and technology. This program is designed to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of the role of microorganisms in food production, preservation, and safety. The curriculum for a B.Sc in Microbiology with honors in Food Technology typically includes courses in microbiology, food microbiology, food chemistry, food processing and preservation, food safety and quality control. Students may also have the opportunity to participate in laboratory work and research projects related to food microbiology and technology.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Learn food safety, microbiological testing, and food processing with this B.Sc honors in food technology.', 'food technology degree, microbiology food tech, B.Sc food technology, food microbiology, Institute of Science, best food science college Gujarat', 'Gain real-world exposure with GMIU’s industry visit program, offering valuable insights into industry practices, guided by expert faculty to enhance your academic journey.', 'B.Sc Microbiology (Hons) in Food Technology – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'B.Sc. Micro. hon. FT', '3', 30, '4', 62500, 33650, 31250, 31600, 31250, 31600, 31250, 31600, 34250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(44, 'G52', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc. Zoology', 'under-graduation-b-sc-zoology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Zoology is one of the most popular branches in Science that involves the study of animals and their biological processes. Zoology courses are offered at the graduate and postgraduate levels both full-time and part time. Candidates can also opt for Ph.D. in Zoology after completing their post-graduation. Candidates in this discipline are basically taught regarding animal anatomy, physiology, biochemistry, genetics, evolution, ecology, behavior, and conservation. Options after pursuing a B.Sc., M.Sc. and Ph.D. in Zoology are varied.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore animal biology, physiology, and biodiversity with a B.Sc in Zoology. Build a path toward research or veterinary careers.', 'B.Sc Zoology, zoology degree, animal biology, life sciences, Institute of Science, biology programs, top zoology colleges in Gujarat', '', 'B.Sc in Zoology – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'B.sc. Zoo', '3', 30, '4', 49400, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(45, 'G53', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc in Botany', 'under-graduation-b-sc-in-botany', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Botany, branch of biology that deals with the study of plants, including their structure, properties, and biochemical processes. Also included are plant classification and the study of plant diseases and of interactions with the environment. The principles and findings of botany have provided the base for such applied sciences as agriculture, horticulture, and forestry.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'Study plant sciences with a B.Sc in Botany. Learn about plant physiology, taxonomy, and biotechnology applications.', 'B.Sc Botany, botany degree, plant biology, plant science course, Institute of Science, undergraduate botany program, top science college Gujarat', '', 'B.Sc in Botany – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'BT', '3', 30, '4', 49400, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(46, 'G54', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Mathematics', 'under-graduation-b-sc-mathematics', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">B.Sc. Mathematics is the study of quantity, structure, space, and change. A Bachelor of Science degree in Mathematics is a culmination of in-depth knowledge of geometry, trigonometry, calculus and other theories. It also explores related topics like Computer Science and Statistics. The study of Mathematics in undergraduate deals with the structure, change and space. Students need to meet the eligibility criteria set up in order to pursue the course. After completing B.Sc. Mathematics, students have various options they can take up and have a promising career ahead as the scope is bright. You can either build your way up in India or manage to land a dream job abroad as well.</span></p>\r\n', 'Develop analytical and logical reasoning with our B.Sc Mathematics program. Ideal for careers in analytics, finance, or academia.', 'B.Sc Mathematics, math degree, pure mathematics, analytical thinking, Institute of Science, top mathematics colleges, UG math courses', '', 'B.Sc in Mathematics – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'MATH', '3', 30, '4', 51900, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 25400, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(47, 'G55', 0, 3, 1, 'B.Sc Physics', 'under-graduation-b-sc-physics', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Physics is the branch of science concerned with the nature and properties of matter and energy. The subject matter of physics includes mechanics, heat, light and other radiation, sound, electricity, magnetism, and the structure of atoms. Physics is one of the most fundamental scientific disciplines, and its main goal is to understand how the universe behaves.</span></p>\r\n', 'Dive into mechanics, quantum physics, and electromagnetism with a B.Sc in Physics. Ideal for research and technology careers.', 'B.Sc Physics, undergraduate physics, quantum physics, mechanics, physics college Gujarat, Institute of Science, top UG physics programs', 'Discover GMIU\'s industry visit program, designed to provide students with hands-on learning opportunities and real-world industry insights for enhanced career growth.', 'B.Sc in Physics – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'PHY', '3', 30, '4', 51900, 28350, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 25950, 26300, 28950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(48, 'G58/G59', 0, 3, 2, 'M.sc. Chemistry ( Organic/Analytical)', 'post-graduation-m-sc-chemistry--organic-analytical-', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Master of Science (MSc) in Chemistry is a graduate-level program that delves deep into various aspects of chemistry, including theoretical principles, laboratory techniques, research methodologies, and practical applications. Here&#39;s an overview of what you might expect from an MSc in Chemistry program. You&#39;ll take advanced courses in organic, inorganic, physical, and analytical chemistry, along with specialized topics such as biochemistry, polymer chemistry, medicinal chemistry, or environmental chemistry.&nbsp;A significant portion of the program involves hands-on laboratory work where you&#39;ll conduct experiments, analyze data, and gain practical experience with sophisticated instruments and techniques.&nbsp;Many MSc programs require students to conduct independent research projects under the supervision of a faculty member. This culminates in a thesis or dissertation that demonstrates your ability to design and execute experiments, analyze results, and draw conclusions. You may be required to give presentations on your research findings or on selected topics in chemistry to your peers and faculty members. Some programs offer elective courses or allow you to specialize in areas such as computational chemistry, materials science, spectroscopy, or chemical engineering, depending on your interests and career goals.Typically, an MSc in Chemistry program lasts for about 1 to 2 years, depending on the institution and whether you&#39;re studying full-time or part-time. Graduates of MSc in Chemistry programs pursue various career paths, including research and development in industries such as pharmaceuticals, biotechnology, cosmetics, and materials science.<br />\r\nOther career options include teaching, environmental science, forensic science, patent law, and government positions.<br />\r\nMost programs require a bachelor&#39;s degree in chemistry or a related field.<br />\r\nAn MSc in Chemistry provides advanced training in chemical theory and experimentation, preparing students for careers in research, industry, academia, and beyond. It offers opportunities for specialization and hands-on experience that are valuable in today&#39;s competitive job market.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'Specialize in organic and analytical chemistry with our M.Sc program. Prepare for research or industrial chemical applications.', 'M.Sc Chemistry, organic chemistry, analytical chemistry, postgraduate chemistry, Institute of Science, top chemistry PG college Gujarat', 'Join GMIU’s industry visit program to gain real-world insights, hands-on experience, and career-building opportunities, guided by experienced faculty mentors.', 'M.Sc in Chemistry – Organic & Analytical – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'M.sc. Chem', '3', 60, '2', 69800, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(49, 'G62', 0, 3, 2, 'M.sc. Microbiology', 'post-graduation-m-sc-microbiology', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Master of Science (M.Sc) in Microbiology is a graduate-level program that focuses on the study of microorganisms, including bacteria, viruses, fungi, and parasites, and their interaction with humans, animals, plants, and the environment. Here&#39;s an overview of what you can expect from an M.Sc in Microbiology program.&nbsp;The curriculum typically includes core courses in microbiology, covering topics such as microbial physiology, genetics, immunology, virology, mycology, and microbial ecology.&nbsp;Practical laboratory work is a significant component of the program. Students engage in hands-on experiments to learn techniques for culturing, isolating, and identifying microorganisms, as well as molecular biology techniques such as PCR (polymerase chain reaction).&nbsp;Some programs offer specializations or elective courses in areas such as medical microbiology, environmental microbiology, industrial microbiology, microbial biotechnology, or bioinformatics.&nbsp;Many M.Sc programs require students to complete a research project or thesis under the supervision of a faculty member. This research component allows students to delve deeper into a specific area of microbiology and develop their critical thinking and research skills.&nbsp;Students may be required to participate in seminars, present research findings, and engage in discussions with peers and faculty members.<br />\r\nThe program emphasizes the practical applications of microbiology in various fields such as medicine, agriculture, food industry, pharmaceuticals, environmental science.&nbsp;Microbiology intersects with other disciplines such as molecular biology, biochemistry, immunology, and genetics. Therefore, students may encounter interdisciplinary coursework and collaborative research opportunities.&nbsp;Graduates of M.Sc in Microbiology programs can pursue careers in research institutions, pharmaceutical companies, biotechnology firms, government agencies, hospitals, clinical laboratories, agricultural organizations, environmental agencies, and academia.&nbsp;Overall, an M.Sc in Microbiology provides students with a strong foundation in microbiological principles, laboratory techniques, and research methodologies, preparing them for careers in a variety of fields related to microbiology and biotechnology.</span></p>\r\n', 'Master microbiological concepts, laboratory techniques, and research methods with our advanced microbiology PG course.', 'M.Sc Microbiology, microbiology PG, research microbiology, Institute of Science, biotech postgraduate, top PG microbiology college', 'GMIU’s industry visit program provides students with practical exposure to real-world scenarios, enhancing learning and fostering industry connections for professional growth.', 'M.Sc in Microbiology – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'M.sc Mico.', '3', 30, '2', 59300, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(50, 'G65', 0, 3, 2, 'M.Sc. Mathematics', 'post-graduation-m-sc-mathematics', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gmiu in M.Sc in Mathematics program is two year post graduation program provides students with advanced training, research experience, and expertise in mathematics, equipping them with the analytical, problem-solving, and critical-thinking skills necessary for success in diverse professional and academic settings.</span></p>\r\n', 'Deepen your knowledge in advanced mathematics, algebra, and applied stats with our M.Sc in Mathematics program.', 'M.Sc Mathematics, PG math course, algebra, applied mathematics, Institute of Science, top PG math college Gujarat', 'Explore GMIU\'s industry visit program led by experienced faculty, offering valuable insights and hands-on learning to help students understand real-world applications', 'M.Sc in Mathematics – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'MATH', '3', 15, '2', 59300, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(51, '', 0, 3, 2, 'M.sc. Industrial Chemistry', 'post-graduation-m-sc-industrial-chemistry', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A Master of Science (MSc) in Industrial Chemistry is a postgraduate program designed to provide students with advanced knowledge and skills in chemistry, particularly in the context of industrial applications. Here&#39;s an overview. The curriculum typically covers advanced topics in organic, inorganic, physical, and analytical chemistry, with a focus on their industrial applications. Courses may include chemical engineering principles, process optimization, and industrial chemistry techniques. Students may have the opportunity to specialize in areas such as polymer chemistry, environmental chemistry, pharmaceutical chemistry, petrochemicals, materials science, or chemical engineering, depending on the program and the interests of the student.<br />\r\nPractical laboratory work is often a significant component of the program. Students engage in experiments, research projects, and hands-on applications of chemical theories and techniques. Many MSc programs include a research component where students work on a thesis or research project under the supervision of faculty members or industry professionals. This allows students to delve into a specific area of industrial chemistry and contribute to advancements in the field.<br />\r\nThe program aims to equip students with skills relevant to the chemical industry, such as process optimization, quality control, regulatory compliance, and product development. Students also learn about safety protocols, environmental considerations, and sustainable practices within the industry.<br />\r\nGraduates of MSc in Industrial Chemistry programs may pursue careers in various sectors including pharmaceuticals, petrochemicals, polymers, materials science, environmental management, food and beverage, and research and development. Job roles may include chemical engineer, research scientist, quality control analyst, production manager, or environmental consultant.<br />\r\nSome graduates may choose to pursue further education, such as a PhD in Chemistry or related fields, to deepen their knowledge and expertise or to pursue careers in academia or research.<br />\r\nOverall, an MSc in Industrial Chemistry provides students with a strong foundation in chemistry and its applications in industrial settings, preparing them for a wide range of career opportunities in the chemical industry.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'Learn chemical industry practices, research, and process control with an M.Sc in Industrial Chemistry.', 'M.Sc Industrial Chemistry, applied chemistry, postgraduate industrial chemistry, Institute of Science, chemical industry PG program', '', 'M.Sc in Industrial Chemistry – Institute of Science', 'N/A', 'M.Sc. IC', '3', 30, '2', 56400, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2023-03-09 07:29:28', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(52, '', 0, 4, 1, 'B.Com', 'under-graduation-b-com', 'Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.', 'Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.', '', '', '', '', '', 'B.Com', '4', 120, '3', 19800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11200, 0, 0, 11000, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 1, '2023-03-09 07:30:33', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
