(89, 'G146', 0, 8, 1, 'BCA', 'under-graduation-bca', 'In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like IOT, Data science, cloud technology.  The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers.  The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology.  With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like IOT, Data science, cloud technology. The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers. The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology. With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.</span></p>\r\n', 'Start your IT career with a BCA degree. Learn programming, web development, and software design.', 'BCA course, UG computer science, programming degree, software development, IT UG program', '', 'Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) – Institute of Computer Applications', 'N/A', 'BCA', '8', 120, '4', 57500, 31150, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 31750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:34:25', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(90, 'G154', 0, 8, 2, 'MCA', 'post-graduation-mca', 'In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like IOT, Data science, cloud technology.  The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers.  The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology.  With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like AI, cyber security, Data science, cloud technology. The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers. The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology. With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.</span></p>\r\n', 'Build a strong foundation in computer science, system architecture, and AI technologies through MCA.', 'MCA course, PG computer science, software engineering, programming PG, IT master’s degree', '', 'Master of Computer Applications (MCA) – Institute of Computer Applications', 'N/A', 'MCA', '8', 60, '2', 80000, 42650, 40000, 40350, 43000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-09 07:34:25', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
