(109, '', 0, 12, 2, 'Master of Social Works', 'post-graduation-master-of-social-works', 'GMIU\'s social work program provides a comprehensive education that combines theoretical knowledge with practical experience. With expert faculty members and a challenging curriculum covering social welfare policy, human behavior and development, diversity and oppression, social work practice, research methods, and ethics, students are prepared to become skilled and compassionate professionals. The program offers ample opportunities for practical experience through internships, field placements, or supervised practice, in a variety of settings such as hospitals, schools, social service agencies, and government organizations. Graduates are well-prepared to pursue rewarding careers in social work and related fields, helping individuals, families, and communities overcome social, emotional, and behavioral challenges to make a positive impact on society.', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">GMIU&#39;s social work program provides a comprehensive education that combines theoretical knowledge with practical experience. With expert faculty members and a challenging curriculum covering social welfare policy, human behavior and development, diversity and oppression, social work practice, research methods, and ethics, students are prepared to become skilled and compassionate professionals. The program offers ample opportunities for practical experience through internships, field placements, or supervised practice, in a variety of settings such as hospitals, schools, social service agencies, and government organizations. Graduates are well-prepared to pursue rewarding careers in social work and related fields, helping individuals, families, and communities overcome social, emotional, and behavioral challenges to make a positive impact on society.</span></p>\r\n', 'Advance your career in community service, counseling, and development work through our MSW program