(129, '', 0, 6, 1, 'Ba Hon. In Mass Communication And Journalism', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-mass-communication-and-journalism', 'Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.', 'Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '6', 60, '3/4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 32800, 32800, 11000, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 1, '2023-03-14 10:25:20', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
