(146, '', 0, 15, 1, 'Hotel Management Hon. IN Reception Operations & Services', 'under-graduation-hotel-management-hon-in-reception-operations--services', 'GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and practical application, GMIU is the ideal choice for anyone seeking a successful career in hotel management.\r\n\r\n	change duration of Hotel Management & Catering Technology (4 years)\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Reception Operations & Services\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Tourism & Hotel Management\r\n	remove Hotel Management Hon. in Hospitality Management\r\n', 'GMIU offers the best hotel management program, providing students with a comprehensive education, experienced faculty, and state-of-the-art facilities. The curriculum covers essential skills such as hotel operations, revenue management, marketing, and customer service, while hands-on learning opportunities through internships and real-world projects provide practical application of knowledge. The college also offers a range of extracurricular activities, modern classrooms, fully equipped labs, and a state-of-the-art hospitality training center, as well as partnerships with leading hotels and hospitality companies for internships, job placements, and mentorship programs. With a focus on industry-relevant knowledge and pract