(173, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BA+MA', 'ug-pg-ba-ma', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">The integrated program offers a focused and continuous learning journey within your chosen field in the Arts and Humanities. You&#39;ll delve into advanced topics and research methodologies from the beginning, fostering a deeper understanding and expertise in your area of interest.</span></span></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">The program structure often emphasizes research methodologies and critical thinking skills throughout the five years. This prepares you to tackle complex problems, analyze information effectively, and potentially contribute to original research within your field.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Explore the details of the specialized program at GMIU, led by expert faculty, designed to equip students with industry-relevant knowledge and skills for success.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'BA + MA (UG + PG) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 30400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(174, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BA+MA (Special Program)', 'ug-pg-ba-ma-special-program-', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The integrated program offers a focused and continuous learning journey within your chosen field in the Arts and Humanities. You&#39;ll delve into advanced topics and research methodologies from the beginning, fostering a deeper understanding and expertise in your area of interest.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>The program structure often emphasizes research methodologies and critical thinking skills throughout the five years. This prepares you to tackle complex problems, analyze information effectively, and potentially contribute to original research within your field.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU\'s specialized program designed to equip students with essential skills and knowledge, guided by expert faculty for a successful career in the field.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'BA + MA (Special Program) UG + PG - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 50800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(175, '', 0, 18, 8, 'BA+MA(INTN. RELATION)', 'diploma-u-g-ba-ma-intn-relation-', '', '<p>N/A</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 0, 'N/A', 40000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 1, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(176, '', 0, 18, 14, 'B.COM+M.COM', 'ug-pg-b-com-m-com', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">The integrated program provides a more focused and in-depth exploration of commerce subjects. You&#39;ll delve into advanced topics and potentially specialize in a specific area like accounting, finance, marketing, or international business right from the beginning. This fosters a stronger understanding and expertise in your chosen field.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"> You&#39;ll build upon foundational commerce concepts in the B.Com years and seamlessly transition to advanced studies and specializations in the M.Com years. This eliminates the need to repeat introductory courses or adjust to a new learning environment during the transition</span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Explore the [Program Name] offered by the Faculty of [Faculty Name] at GMIU. Get details on curriculum, career opportunities, and the admission process.', '', '', 'B.Com + M.Com (UG + PG) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 30400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(177, '', 0, 18, 14, 'B.com+M.com (Special Program)', 'ug-pg-b-com-m-com-special-program-', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The integrated program provides a more focused and in-depth exploration of commerce subjects. You&#39;ll delve into advanced topics and potentially specialize in a specific area like accounting, finance, marketing, or international business right from the beginning. This fosters a stronger understanding and expertise in your chosen field.&nbsp;You&#39;ll build upon foundational commerce concepts in the B.Com years and seamlessly transition to advanced studies and specializations in the M.Com years. This eliminates the need to repeat introductory courses or adjust to a new learning environment during the transition.</span></p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIUs innovative program designed to enhance learning with a strong focus on practical application, industry insights, and skill development.', '', '', 'B.Com + M.Com (Special Program) UG + PG - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 50800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(178, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BA+MSW', 'ug-pg-ba-msw', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d\">Integrated BA+MSW programs allow students to begin focusing on social work coursework and field experiences earlier in their academic careers. This early specialization enables students to develop a deeper understanding of social work principles, theories, and practices from the outset of their studies.&nbsp; Integrated BA+MSW programs provide students with opportunities to build professional relationships with faculty, peers, and practitioners in the field of social work. These networking opportunities can be invaluable for securing internships, field placements, and job opportunities upon graduation.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Enhance your learning experience with GMIUs program led by experienced faculty. Gain in-depth knowledge and practical skills that are essential for your career growth.', '', '', 'BA + MSW (UG + PG) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 30400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(179, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BCA+MCA', 'ug-pg-bca-mca', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In Gyanmanjari Innovative University one can study computer science in existing trending courses and honor degree in UG and PG level as per new education policy (NEP-2020) with important issues like skill and innovation in subjects like AI, cyber security, Data science, cloud technology. The course here has been prepared with the guidance of industry experts with more focus on the current industry demand and practical exposure. Along with studies, various conferences, competitions and programs are being organized to help students develop life skills and become more competent national and international job seekers and givers. The students of the institute who have been placed in various famous industries like bharatpay, TCL and IBM and the experts periodically conduct expert sessions and industrial visits, internships are being done so that the students can make their best career by understanding the current needs. Qualities like startup and entrepreneurship and trending courses like In subjects like IOT, data science, education is being developed by developing various leaning approaches and education systems in which students advance in the direction of extraordinary rather than ordinary courses by developing a deep and proper understanding of the field of technology. With excellent infrastructural facilities, personal mentorship, club activities and excellent faculty, students will thrive in the challenging environment of Computer Science.</span></p>\r\n', 'Enhance your academic journey with GMIUs program, combining in-depth learning, industry exposure, and skill-building opportunities to prepare students for future success.', '', '', 'BCA + MCA (UG + PG) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', 'N/A', 'N/A', '18', 10, '5', 55400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(180, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BBA+MBA', 'ug-pg-bba-mba', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">The integrated course BBA+MBA offers student to gain a strong foundation in core business areas accounting, finance, marketing, management during the BBA years. Seamlessly transition to advanced studies and potentially specialize in a specific area (marketing analytics, international business, entrepreneurship) during the MBA portion.Get introduced to leadership, negotiation, and strategic thinking skills earlier than a traditional path. This can be valuable if you aspire to managerial positions after graduation.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU\'s program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] – offering cutting-edge courses designed to provide students with skills for success in their careers.', '', '', 'BBA + MBA (UG + PG) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '18', 10, '5', 55400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:17:39', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0),
(181, '', 0, 18, 14, 'BBA+ MBA (Special Program)', 'ug-pg-bba-mba-special-program-', '', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The integrated course BBA+MBA offers student to gain a strong foundation in core business areas accounting, finance, marketing, management during the BBA years. Seamlessly transition to advanced studies and potentially specialize in a specific area (marketing analytics, international business, entrepreneurship) during the MBA portion.Get introduced to leadership, negotiation, and strategic thinking skills earlier than a traditional path. This can be valuable if you aspire to managerial positions after graduation.</span></p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s specialized program designed to provide students with key skills, knowledge, and real-world exposure, guided by expert faculty for career success.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'BBA + MBA (Special Program) UG + PG - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '18', 10, '5', 59800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2023-03-14 12:20:41', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
