(320, 'G68', 0, 3, 2, 'M.Sc Zoology', 'post-graduation-m-sc-zoology', '', '', 'Advance your knowledge with an M.Sc in Zoology. Study animal physiology, ecology, taxonomy, genetics, and wildlife biology for a rewarding career in life scienc', 'M.Sc zoology, postgraduate zoology, animal biology, wildlife biology, ecology and taxonomy, life sciences degree, zoology research, zoology colleges, MSc in animal science, best zoology programs India', 'Experience GMIU’s industry visit program, offering hands-on learning, industry insights, and career development opportunities with guidance from experienced faculty.', 'M.Sc Zoology – Explore Animal Biology & Advanced Life Sciences', '', '', '', 30, '2', 59300, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-06-06 08:40:42', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(321, 'G67', 0, 3, 2, 'M.Sc  Botany', 'post-graduation-m-sc-botany', '', '', 'Pursue M.Sc in Botany to explore plant physiology, genetics, ecology, and molecular biology. Ideal for careers in research, teaching, and environmental manageme', 'M.Sc botany, botany post graduation, plant biology course, plant genetics, plant physiology, MSc in botany, botany research, plant science degree, environmental biology, botany colleges India', 'Participate in GMIU’s industry visit program to gain valuable practical knowledge, real-world exposure, and career insights, guided by experienced faculty.', 'M.Sc Botany – Advanced Plant Science & Research', '', '', '', 30, '2', 59300, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-06-06 08:45:38', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(322, 'G66', 0, 3, 2, 'M.Sc  Physics', 'post-graduation-m-sc-physics', '', '', 'Enroll in M.Sc Physics to study quantum mechanics, electromagnetism, astrophysics, and more. Build a strong foundation for research and academic careers.', 'M.Sc physics, physics postgraduate course, theoretical physics, experimental physics, quantum mechanics, MSc physics colleges, physics research programs, advanced physics studies, physics degree India', '', 'M.Sc Physics – Advanced Theoretical & Experimental Physics', '', '', '', 30, '2', 59300, 32300, 29650, 30000, 32650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-06-06 08:48:21', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(323, 'G104', 0, 5, 2, 'MBA in Hospital Management', 'post-graduation-mba-in-hospital-management', '', '', 'Prepare for leadership roles in the healthcare sector with an MBA in Hospital Management. Learn healthcare operations, hospital planning, and medical administra', 'MBA hospital management, healthcare MBA, hospital administration course, healthcare management degree, medical management, hospital planning, healthcare operations, MBA in healthcare, health service management', '', 'MBA in Hospital Management – Healthcare Leadership & Administration', '', '', '', 30, '2', 81900, 43600, 40950, 41300, 43950, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-06-06 08:59:21', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', 0, 0),
(324, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BA + Diploma in Fashion Design', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-ba--diploma-in-fashion-design', '', '<p>The fusion of a Bachelor of Arts (BA) with a focus on Fashion Designing creates a powerful dual degree program that marries business acumen with creativity in the dynamic world of fashion. This specialized curriculum aims to produce graduates who not only understand the intricacies of the fashion industry but also possess essential managerial and entrepreneurial skills. Individuals with a BA + Fashion Designing dual degree are well-prepared to navigate the business side of the fashion world, whether in areas of retail management, brand development, or entrepreneurial ventures within the fashion industry. This unique combination equips graduates to not only create innovative and trendsetting designs but also to strategically manage and market fashion products in an ever-evolving market.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 07:29:23', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(325, '', 0, 4, 1, 'B.Com. + Diploma Fashion Design', 'under-graduation-b-com--diploma-fashion-design', '', '<p>The fusion of a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) with a focus on Fashion Designing creates a powerful dual degree program that marries business acumen with creativity in the dynamic world of fashion. This specialized curriculum aims to produce graduates who not only understand the intricacies of the fashion industry but also possess essential managerial and entrepreneurial skills. Individuals with a B.Com + Fashion Designing dual degree are well-prepared to navigate the business side of the fashion world, whether in areas of retail management, brand development, or entrepreneurial ventures within the fashion industry. This unique combination equips graduates to not only create innovative and trendsetting designs but also to strategically manage and market fashion products in an ever-evolving market.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 07:39:02', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
