(327, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Tech + Diploma Fashion Design', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-tech--diploma-fashion-design', '', '<p>The fusion of a Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.) with a focus on Fashion Designing creates a powerful dual degree program that marries business acumen with creativity in the dynamic world of fashion. This specialized curriculum aims to produce graduates who not only understand the intricacies of the fashion industry but also possess essential managerial and entrepreneurial skills. Individuals with a B.Tech. + Fashion Designing dual degree are well-prepared to navigate the business side of the fashion world, whether in areas of retail management, brand development, or entrepreneurial ventures within the fashion industry. This unique combination equips graduates to not only create innovative and trendsetting designs but also to strategically manage and market fashion products in an ever-evolving market.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 10:39:25', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(328, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm. + Diploma Fashion Design', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--diploma-fashion-design', '', '<p>The fusion of a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm.) with a focus on Fashion Designing creates a powerful dual degree program that marries business acumen with creativity in the dynamic world of fashion. This specialized curriculum aims to produce graduates who not only understand the intricacies of the fashion industry but also possess essential managerial and entrepreneurial skills. Individuals with a B.Pharm + Fashion Designing dual degree are well-prepared to navigate the business side of the fashion world, whether in areas of retail management, brand development, or entrepreneurial ventures within the fashion industry. This unique combination equips graduates to not only create innovative and trendsetting designs but also to strategically manage and market fashion products in an ever-evolving market.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 10:45:50', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(329, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc. + Diploma Fashion Design', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--diploma-fashion-design', '', '<p>The fusion of a Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) with a focus on Fashion Designing creates a powerful dual degree program that marries business acumen with creativity in the dynamic world of fashion. This specialized curriculum aims to produce graduates who not only understand the intricacies of the fashion industry but also possess essential managerial and entrepreneurial skills. Individuals with a B.Sc. + Fashion Designing dual degree are well-prepared to navigate the business side of the fashion world, whether in areas of retail management, brand development, or entrepreneurial ventures within the fashion industry. This unique combination equips graduates to not only create innovative and trendsetting designs but also to strategically manage and market fashion products in an ever-evolving market.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 1, '2024-07-05 10:57:41', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(330, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.TECH + B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-tech--b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Tech degree with a B.Com in fields like Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, or Innovation &amp; Startup provides a unique interdisciplinary education that blends technical engineering skills with a deep understanding of commerce. This combination prepares students for diverse career opportunities such as developing financial software, managing banking and insurance technologies, applying data-driven strategies in marketing, or launching and managing tech startups. Graduates gain robust skills in technical problem-solving, financial analysis, business management, and innovative thinking, making them highly valuable in tech-driven financial sectors and entrepreneurial ventures.</p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIUs program designed to enhance students skills with practical learning experiences, industry insights, and opportunities for career advancement.', '', '', 'B.Tech + B.Com (Finance, Banking, Marketing & Management) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 09:56:07', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(331, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.TECH + B.Sc(Physics,Chemistry,Mathematics,ZOO,Micro)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-tech--b-sc-physics-chemistry-mathematics-zoo-micro-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Tech degree with a B.Sc in fields like Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Zoology, or Microbiology provides a robust interdisciplinary education that merges engineering principles with in-depth scientific knowledge. This combination prepares students for diverse career opportunities in areas such as developing advanced materials, conducting scientific research, solving complex mathematical problems, innovating in biotechnology, or working in environmental and ecological fields. Graduates gain a unique skill set that includes technical problem-solving, analytical thinking, and scientific expertise, making them well-suited for roles in research and development, engineering, and various scientific industries.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program that focuses on skill-building, industry exposure, and practical learning to prepare students for successful careers. Learn more about the curriculum.', '', '', 'B.Tech + B.Sc (Physics, Chemistry, Zoology, Microbiology) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:07:19', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(332, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.TECH +  Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-tech--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a B.Tech degree with Fashion Designing offers a unique interdisciplinary education that merges technical engineering skills with creative fashion design expertise. This combination prepares students for diverse career opportunities such as developing innovative fashion technologies, designing smart textiles, creating eco-friendly clothing, or enhancing the functionality and aesthetics of wearable tech. Graduates gain a unique skill set that includes technical problem-solving, creative design, and an understanding of both fashion trends and engineering principles, making them well-suited for roles in fashion technology, product development, and fashion entrepreneurship.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs specialized program, designed to bridge academic learning with real-world industry applications. Enhance your skills, gain practical insights, and prepare for success.', '', 'Explore the industry visit program at GMIU, offering students real-world exposure and insights to enhance their learning and career development.', 'B.Tech + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:08:02', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(333, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc  +BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with a BA in fields like Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass Communication and Journalism, or Political Science provides a well-rounded education that blends scientific knowledge with social sciences and humanities. This combination prepares students for diverse career paths such as conducting archaeological research, working in public administration and policy, engaging in journalism and media, or analyzing political systems. Graduates gain a versatile skill set that includes scientific analysis, research methodologies, communication skills, and a deep understanding of societal and political contexts, making them valuable in research, government, media, and policy-making roles.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the diverse programs offered at GMIU under the guidance of expert faculty. Enhance your knowledge and skills to excel in your career with industry-relevant courses.', '', '', 'B.Sc + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:08:42', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(334, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc  + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, Agriculture Business Management )', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--bba-fintech-business-analysis-entrepreneurship-digital-marketing-agriculture-business-management-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with a BBA in areas like Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, or Agriculture Business Management offers a balanced education that integrates scientific knowledge with business acumen. This blend prepares students for varied career paths such as developing financial technologies, analyzing business data, launching startups, implementing digital marketing strategies, or managing agribusinesses. Graduates acquire a diverse skill set, including scientific analysis, business strategy, digital skills, and management capabilities, equipping them to tackle complex challenges in both scientific and business environments.</p>\r\n', 'Explore the details of the program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] at GMIU. Learn about the curriculum and opportunities to advance your career.', 'dual degree, BBA, BSc, GMIU, Fintech, Agri Business, Digital Marketing', '', 'B.Sc + BBA (Fintech, Digital Marketing, Agri Business) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:09:11', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(335, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, Web Technology)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--bca-cyber-security-data-science-mobile-applications-cloud-technology-web-technology-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with a BCA in fields like Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, or Web Technology creates a strong foundation in both scientific inquiry and computing. This blend prepares students for careers in developing secure systems, analyzing data, creating mobile and web applications, or managing cloud infrastructures. Graduates gain a unique skill set that includes scientific problem-solving, advanced IT skills, and an understanding of emerging technologies, making them well-equipped for roles in technology development, data analysis, and cybersecurity.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s specialized program designed to equip students with essential skills and knowledge, led by expert faculty to prepare them for successful careers.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Sc + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Cloud Tech) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:09:37', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(336, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc +B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc-b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with a B.Com in areas like Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, or Innovation &amp; Startup offers a diverse education that merges scientific knowledge with financial and business expertise. This combination prepares students for various career paths such as financial analysis, managing banking and insurance operations, applying marketing strategies, or launching innovative startups. Graduates acquire a well-rounded skill set that includes scientific analytical skills, financial acumen, business management, and entrepreneurial thinking, making them suitable for roles in finance, marketing, business development, and startup ventures.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s specialized program, offering in-depth knowledge and practical skills, led by expert faculty to prepare students for successful careers in their field.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Sc + B.Com (Finance, Banking, Marketing & Startup) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:10:06', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(337, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc + Bio Tech', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--bio-tech', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with a focus on Bio Tech provides a comprehensive education that blends scientific principles with biotechnology applications. This combination prepares students for careers in fields such as genetic research, pharmaceuticals, agricultural biotechnology, and environmental biotech. Graduates gain a robust skill set in scientific research, biotechnological techniques, and data analysis, equipping them to work on developing new biotech solutions, improving healthcare outcomes, and advancing agricultural practices. This interdisciplinary background is valuable for roles in research and development, biotech companies, and scientific laboratories.</p>\r\n', 'Learn about GMIU\'s program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] – offering specialized courses designed to equip students with industry-relevant skills and knowledge.', '', 'Explore GMIU\'s industry visit program under the Dual Degree Programs – providing students with hands-on experience and insights into real-world industry practices.', 'B.Sc + Bio Tech Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU)', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:10:32', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(338, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Sc + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-sc--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a B.Sc degree with Fashion Designing merges scientific knowledge with creative design skills. This combination prepares students for careers where scientific principles are applied to fashion, such as developing innovative textiles, integrating technology with fashion (e.g., wearable tech), and advancing sustainable design practices. Graduates gain a unique skill set that includes scientific analysis, textile science, creative design, and an understanding of fashion trends, making them well-suited for roles in fashion technology, textile development, and sustainable fashion initiatives.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s tailored program designed to equip students with vital skills and knowledge, guided by expert faculty to prepare them for successful careers.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Sc + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:10:58', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(339, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA +BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba-ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a BBA degree with a BA in fields like Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass Communication and Journalism, or Political Science blends business management skills with specialized knowledge in social sciences and humanities. This combination prepares students for diverse careers, such as managing archaeological projects, improving public administration efficiency, working in media and journalism, or analyzing political systems and policies. Graduates gain a versatile skill set that includes business strategy, communication, research, and an understanding of societal and political contexts, making them well-suited for roles in management, policy-making, media, and public service.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the program offerings under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] at GMIU. Learn about course details, career prospects, and how to apply.', 'BBA, BA, Journalism, Public Administration, Archaeology, GMIU', '', 'BBA + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - Gyanmanjari University', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-07-26 10:11:30', '2025-06-26 06:42:22', 0, 0),
(340, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA +BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, Web Technology)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba-bca-cyber-security-data-science-mobile-applications-cloud-technology-web-technology-', '', '<p>Combining a BBA degree with a BCA in fields like Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, or Web Technology merges business management skills with advanced computing and IT expertise. This blend prepares students for careers in managing tech projects, developing secure systems, analyzing data, or creating digital solutions. Graduates acquire a diverse skill set that includes business strategy, IT management, cybersecurity, data analysis, and application development, making them well-equipped for roles in tech-driven business environments, project management, and technology consulting.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s specialized program, offering students expert guidance and practical knowledge to enhance their skills and prepare them for career success.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'BBA + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Cloud Tech) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:11:55', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(341, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA + B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba--b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a BBA degree with a B.Com in areas like Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, or Innovation &amp; Startup integrates business management skills with comprehensive financial and commercial knowledge. This combination prepares students for careers in financial management, banking, marketing strategy, and entrepreneurial ventures. Graduates gain a robust skill set in business strategy, financial analysis, marketing, and innovation, equipping them for roles in finance, business development, marketing, and startup management.</p>\r\n', 'Explore the GMIU program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] – designed to offer specialized knowledge, practical skills, and excellent career opportunities for students.', '', '', 'BBA + B.Com (Dual Degree) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:12:31', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0),
(342, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) with Fashion Designing offers a unique edge by merging creative fashion skills with business acumen. This combination equips you to excel in roles such as managing fashion brands, developing marketing strategies, and running your own fashion business. It provides a comprehensive understanding of both the artistic and commercial aspects of the industry, making you well-suited for entrepreneurial ventures, managerial positions, or consulting within the fashion sector.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU\'s program offering specialized knowledge and skills, led by expert faculty, designed to prepare students for successful careers in their field of study.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'BBA + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:13:00', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(343, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.COM + BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-com--ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) with degrees in Archaeology, Public Administration, Mass Communication and Journalism, and Political Science offers a diverse skill set that spans business, governance, media, and cultural studies. This interdisciplinary background equips you with a broad understanding of historical and contemporary issues, effective communication strategies, and insights into public administration and political dynamics, making you well-suited for roles in government, media, cultural heritage management, or public relations.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU\'s specialized program, offering students expert-led training and skills to succeed in their field, preparing them for a bright career ahead.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Com + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:13:23', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(344, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Com + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, Web Technology)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-com--bca-cyber-security-data-science-mobile-applications-cloud-technology-web-technology-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) with a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) in Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, and Web Technology provides a robust foundation in both business and advanced technology. This blend of skills is ideal for roles that require both financial acumen and technical expertise, such as IT management, cybersecurity analysis, data-driven decision making, and technology project management. It positions you well for careers in tech-driven business environments, offering opportunities in financial technology, IT consulting, and digital strategy.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the detailed program offered by GMIU, designed to provide students with comprehensive knowledge and skills in their respective fields of study.', '', '', 'B.Com + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Cloud Tech) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:13:48', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(345, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Com + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, Agriculture Business Management )', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-com--bba-fintech-business-analysis-entrepreneurship-digital-marketing-agriculture-business-management-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) with a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) in Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, and Agriculture Business Management provides a comprehensive skill set that spans finance, business strategy, and technology. This combination prepares you for a variety of roles, including fintech innovation, business analytics, digital marketing strategy, entrepreneurial ventures, and management within the agriculture sector. It equips you with the tools to thrive in diverse industries by integrating financial knowledge with strategic business insights and digital expertise.</p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIU’s program offering under the guidance of experienced faculty. Equip yourself with the knowledge and skills needed for a successful career in your field.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Com + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Agri Business) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:14:12', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(346, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Com + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-com--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) with Fashion Designing merges financial and business management skills with creative design expertise. This combination enables you to effectively manage fashion enterprises, handle financial aspects of fashion businesses, and develop strategic marketing plans. It equips you to excel in roles such as fashion brand management, retail operations, product development, and entrepreneurship within the fashion industry.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the GMIU program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] – providing expert knowledge, hands-on experience, and career opportunities in [Program Field].', '', '', 'B.Com + Fashion Designing (Dual Degree) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:14:35', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0),
(347, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BCA+ BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bca-ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) with a Bachelor of Arts (BA) in Archaeology, Public Administration, Mass Communication and Journalism, and Political Science blends technical proficiency with diverse knowledge in humanities and social sciences. This mix prepares you for roles that require both IT skills and expertise in fields like cultural heritage management, public policy, media, and political analysis. It opens opportunities in tech-driven sectors that intersect with these disciplines, such as digital media, data analysis in public administration, or technology in archaeology.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program focused on providing students with industry exposure and practical learning opportunities, bridging the gap between academia and professional environments.', '', '', 'BCA + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:14:59', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(348, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BCA + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, Agriculture Business Management ).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bca--bba-fintech-business-analysis-entrepreneurship-digital-marketing-agriculture-business-management--', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) with a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) in Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, and Agriculture Business Management creates a powerful synergy of technical and business skills. This combination prepares you for a range of roles including fintech development, business analytics, digital marketing strategy, tech entrepreneurship, and management within agriculture. It equips you with both the IT expertise and business insights needed to drive innovation and success in tech-driven business environments.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program offering focused on skill development, industry insights, and real-world applications, designed to enhance students academic and professional growth.', '', '', 'BCA + BBA (Fintech, Digital Marketing, Agri Business) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:15:22', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(349, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BCA +B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bca-b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) with a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) focusing on Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, and Innovation &amp; Startup creates a robust skill set bridging technology and business. This blend prepares you for diverse roles such as financial technology solutions, data-driven marketing strategies, management within financial institutions, and entrepreneurial ventures. It equips you with the technical proficiency to implement digital solutions and the business acumen to drive innovation and strategic growth.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the program offerings at GMIU, designed to provide comprehensive education and practical knowledge in various fields for a successful career.', '', '', 'BCA + B.Com (Finance, Banking, Marketing & Management) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:15:45', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(350, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BCA + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bca--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) with Fashion Designing integrates technical skills with creative design expertise. This combination enables you to leverage technology in fashion, such as developing fashion-related software, managing digital fashion platforms, or creating innovative design tools. It prepares you for roles in tech-driven fashion environments, such as fashion tech startups, digital design, e-commerce platforms, and fashion industry analytics.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program details for specialized courses under the faculty of engineering, designed to equip students with the skills for successful careers.', '', '', 'BCA + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:16:08', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(351, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA +BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba-ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) with a Bachelor of Arts (BA) in Archaeology, Public Administration, Mass Communication and Journalism, and Political Science offers a diverse skill set that bridges business management with a deep understanding of cultural, political, and media contexts. This combination prepares you for roles that require both strategic business skills and expertise in areas such as heritage management, public policy, media relations, and political analysis. It equips you for careers in sectors like public administration, media management, cultural preservation, and political consulting.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program designed to provide students with comprehensive academic and practical insights, fostering skill development and industry readiness for career success.', '', '', 'BBA + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:16:34', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(352, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA +B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba-b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) with a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) focusing on Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, and Innovation &amp; Startup provides a comprehensive foundation in both business strategy and financial management. This blend equips you for roles in financial planning, business analysis, marketing strategy, and entrepreneurial ventures. It prepares you to navigate complex business environments with a strong grasp of finance, management, and innovative business practices.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program offering a comprehensive curriculum focused on skill-building, practical knowledge, and industry expertise to shape your professional growth.', '', '', 'BBA + B.Com (Finance, Banking, Marketing & Startup) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:17:01', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(353, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA +BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, Web Technology)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba-bca-cyber-security-data-science-mobile-applications-cloud-technology-web-technology-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) with a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) specializing in Cyber Security, Data Science, Mobile Applications, Cloud Technology, and Web Technology merges business management with advanced tech skills. This combination prepares you for roles that require both strategic oversight and technical expertise, such as IT management, cybersecurity strategy, data-driven decision making, and technology project management. It positions you well for careers in tech-driven business environments, offering opportunities in managing tech innovations and leading digital transformation efforts.</p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIUs program focusing on developing critical skills, hands-on experiences, and industry insights, empowering students for successful professional careers.', '', '', 'BBA + BCA (Cyber Security, Data Science, Cloud Tech) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-07-26 10:17:25', '2025-06-26 06:24:24', 0, 0),
(354, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BBA + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bba--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) with Fashion Designing blends business acumen with creative design skills. This combination prepares you for roles such as fashion brand management, product development, and marketing within the fashion industry. It equips you to handle the business aspects of fashion, including operations, finance, and strategic planning, while also understanding design and trends. This dual expertise is ideal for managing fashion enterprises, launching your own brand, or working in fashion marketing and retail.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs specialized programs under expert faculty guidance, designed to enhance skills and prepare students for a successful career in their chosen fields.', '', '', 'BBA + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-07-26 10:18:17', '2025-06-26 06:43:40', 0, 0),
(355, '', 0, 22, 13, 'BA + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-ba--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) with Fashion Designing merges a broad liberal arts education with specialized design skills. This combination offers a well-rounded perspective, enhancing your creativity and critical thinking in fashion. It prepares you for roles such as fashion design, styling, or merchandising, while also providing a strong foundation in communication, cultural analysis, and aesthetic appreciation. This blend can be particularly valuable for careers in fashion journalism, brand development, or educational roles within the fashion industry.</p>\r\n', 'Explore the program offered under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] at GMIU. Gain valuable skills and knowledge for a successful career in your field.', '', '', 'BA + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari Innovative University', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:18:36', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0),
(356, '', 0, 22, 13, 'Bio Tech + B.Sc (Physics,Chemistry,Mathematics,ZOO,Micro)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bio-tech--b-sc-physics-chemistry-mathematics-zoo-micro-', '', '<p>Combining a degree in Bio Tech with a Bachelor of Science (B.Sc) in Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Zoology, or Microbiology creates a diverse scientific background with strong interdisciplinary connections. This blend equips you for roles in research and development, where you can apply biological techniques alongside principles from physics, chemistry, or mathematics. It prepares you for careers in biotech research, environmental science, pharmaceuticals, or scientific analysis, leveraging your understanding of both biological systems and quantitative methods.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s specialized program, providing students with essential skills and knowledge to succeed in their field, guided by expert faculty for career growth.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'Bio Tech + B.Sc (Physics, Chemistry, Zoology, Micro) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:18:59', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(357, '', 0, 22, 13, 'Bio Tech +Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-bio-tech-fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining Bio Tech with Fashion Designing merges scientific expertise with creative design. This unique blend can lead to innovative applications in the fashion industry, such as developing sustainable materials, incorporating biotechnology in fabric production, or creating smart textiles with embedded technology. It opens opportunities in areas like fashion tech, textile research, and sustainable fashion, where you can apply biotechnological advancements to enhance fashion design and production processes.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s program led by expert faculty, designed to provide students with specialized knowledge and practical skills, preparing them for successful careers.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'Bio Tech + Fashion Designing Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:19:19', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(358, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm + BA (Archaeology, Public Administration (Civil Services), Mass communication and Journalism, Political Science).', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--ba-archaeology-public-administration-civil-services--mass-communication-and-journalism-political-science-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) with a Bachelor of Arts (BA) in Archaeology, Public Administration, Mass Communication and Journalism, and Political Science blends pharmaceutical knowledge with a diverse understanding of humanities and social sciences. This combination opens career paths in pharmaceutical policy and management, public health communication, and roles involving the intersection of healthcare and media or public administration. It prepares you for careers in pharmaceutical research, health policy, public relations within the healthcare sector, or roles in cultural and historical health studies.</p>\r\n', 'Discover the program details for the course under Faculty of [Faculty Name] at GMIU. Enhance your skills with academic excellence and practical knowledge.', '', '', 'B.Pharm + BA (Archaeology, Public Admin, Journalism) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:19:40', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `tbl_program` (`id`, `branch_code`, `short_no`, `faculty_id`, `level_id`, `name`, `program_slug`, `short_description`, `description`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `industry_meta_description`, `pageTitle`, `video_link`, `shortname`, `code`, `intake`, `duration`, `regular`, `sem1`, `sem2`, `sem3`, `sem4`, `sem5`, `sem6`, `sem7`, `sem8`, `blended_mode`, `honors`, `international`, `genius`, `token1`, `token`, `minor`, `token_minor`, `token_genius`, `token_international`, `token_honors`, `token_blended_mode`, `remaining_fee`, `yearfee`, `is_active`, `is_delete`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`) VALUES
(359, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, Agriculture Business Management )', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--bba-fintech-business-analysis-entrepreneurship-digital-marketing-agriculture-business-management-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) with a Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) in Fintech, Business Analysis, Entrepreneurship, Digital Marketing, and Agriculture Business Management merges pharmaceutical expertise with advanced business skills. This combination prepares you for roles that bridge healthcare and business, such as managing pharmaceutical companies, innovating in health tech, or developing digital marketing strategies for health products. It also equips you to explore entrepreneurial ventures in the pharmaceutical industry, analyze business opportunities, or manage agricultural health solutions.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIU’s program offering specialized knowledge and skills under expert faculty guidance, preparing students for a successful career in their chosen field.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Pharm + BBA (Fintech, Business Analysis, Agri Business) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:20:00', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(360, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm + B.Com ( Finanace and Accounting , Banking &amp; Insurance , Marketing &amp; Management, Innovation &amp; Startup)', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--b-com--finanace-and-accounting--banking-amp-insurance--marketing-amp-management-innovation-amp-startup-', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) with a Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) focusing on Finance and Accounting, Banking &amp; Insurance, Marketing &amp; Management, and Innovation &amp; Startup merges pharmaceutical knowledge with comprehensive business skills. This combination equips you to manage pharmaceutical businesses, handle financial operations, navigate the banking and insurance sectors, and drive innovation within the industry. It prepares you for roles such as pharmaceutical finance management, business development in healthcare, or launching and managing startups in the pharmaceutical or health tech sectors.</p>\r\n', 'Explore GMIUs program offering valuable industry insights, fostering skill development, and enhancing students practical knowledge to boost their career readiness.', '', '', 'B.Pharm + B.Com (Finance, Banking, Marketing & Management) - GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:20:26', '2025-06-14 09:00:22', 0, 0),
(361, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm  + Bio Tech', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--bio-tech', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) with Bio Tech integrates pharmaceutical knowledge with advanced biotechnology skills. This combination opens up opportunities in pharmaceutical research and development, where you can apply biotech techniques to drug discovery and development. It also prepares you for roles in areas such as biotechnology-driven pharmaceuticals, personalized medicine, and biopharmaceutical manufacturing, blending expertise in drug development with cutting-edge biotechnological innovations.</p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIU’s specialized program offering students in-depth knowledge and practical skills, guided by expert faculty, for successful career advancement.', 'GMIU programs, dual degrees, UG PG courses, admission, Gyanmanjari University, career development, innovative university programs', '', 'B.Pharm + Bio Tech Dual Degree - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:20:52', '2025-06-14 09:01:24', 0, 0),
(362, '', 0, 22, 13, 'B.Pharm  + Fashion Designing', 'under-graduation-dual-degree-b-pharm--fashion-designing', '', '<p>Combining a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm) with Fashion Designing merges pharmaceutical expertise with creative design skills. This unique blend can lead to innovative applications in areas such as the development of skin care and cosmetic products, where your pharmaceutical knowledge can enhance product formulation and safety. It also opens opportunities in fashion tech, where you might work on integrating health-related technologies with wearable fashion. This combination can be particularly valuable in creating health-conscious fashion products and exploring new intersections between wellness and style.</p>\r\n', 'Explore the GMIU program under the Faculty of [Faculty Name] – offering specialized education, practical skills, and career opportunities in [Program Field].', '', '', 'B.Pharm + Fashion Designing (Dual Degree) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '', 5, '4', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-07-26 10:21:14', '2025-06-14 08:58:37', 0, 0),
(363, 'G41', 0, 2, 2, 'Pharmaceutical Quality Assurance', 'post-graduation-master-of-pharmacy', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The&nbsp; Master of Pharmacy (M.Pharm) is a postgraduate degree focusing on advanced pharmaceutical sciences, typically pursued after completing a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm). The program usually spans two years and is designed to provide in-depth knowledge in specific areas of pharmacy, preparing students for careers in research, academia, industry, and healthcare.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Core Objectives:</strong><br />\r\n- Deepen understanding of pharmaceutical science and research.<br />\r\n- Develop specialized knowledge in areas like pharmaceutics, pharmacology, pharmaceutical chemistry, or quality assurance.<br />\r\n- Train students in advanced laboratory techniques, drug development, formulation, and quality control.<br />\r\n- Foster analytical, research, and problem-solving skills.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Specializations:</strong><br />\r\n<strong>1. Pharmaceutics</strong>: Focus on the formulation and development of drugs.<br />\r\n<strong>2. Pharmaceutical Quality Assurance:</strong> Emphasizes quality control, regulations, and standards in pharmaceutical production.<br />\r\nCourse Structure:<br />\r\n- Year 1 ( Semester-1 and 2) : Theoretical coursework combined with laboratory work, focusing on specialized subjects depending on the chosen field.<br />\r\n- Year 2 (Semester-3 and 4) : Research project or dissertation work where students apply their learning to practical research problems.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Career Opportunities:</strong><br />\r\nGraduates can pursue roles in:<br />\r\n- Pharmaceutical Industry: Formulation scientist, quality control, regulatory affairs.<br />\r\n- Research and Development: Engaged in drug development and formulation.<br />\r\n- Academia: Teaching and research positions in universities or colleges.<br />\r\n- Healthcare: Clinical pharmacist or hospital pharmacist roles.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'Explore pharmacy university programs, M. Pharmacy colleges in Bhavnagar and Gujarat, and online admission for pharmacy degrees. Learn about pharmaceutical science and medical science education.', 'pharmacy university, pharmacy program, university admission, university program, pharmacy degree programs, education university, health care colleges, university apply online, university degree, teaching university, pharmacy bachelor degree, pharmacy study, medical science, pharmaceutical science degree, pharmacy course, science research, colleges and universities, education colleges, degree in pharmacy, student university, pharmaceutical course, best M. Pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, best M. Pharmacy college in Gujarat, best M. Pharmacy college near me, best M. Pharmacy college in my city, top pharmacy college, top pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, top pharmacy college in Gujarat, top pharmacy college near me, top pharmacy college in my city, top M. Pharmacy college in Bhavnagar, top M. Pharmacy college in Gujarat, top M. Pharmacy college near me, top M. Pharmacy college in my city', 'Discover GMIU’s industry visit program designed to provide students with valuable industry insights, hands-on experience, and career-oriented skills under expert guidance.', 'M. Pharmacy (Postgraduate) - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', 'P. Ceutics', '', 18, '2', 117000, 64075, 61425, 61775, 64425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-08-22 11:46:04', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(364, 'G37', 0, 1, 2, 'Information Technology', 'post-graduation-information-technology', '', '<p>The Department of Information Technology of GMIU offers Master of Technology (M. Tech) in I.T. Engineering is a postgraduate degree. Duration of course is 2 years. The course is divided into 4 semesters which includes theory and practical learning. The students who possess interest in Software application can opt for this course. The basic subjects taught during the course are Advanced Algorithms, Software Engineering, Data Structures, Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, Cloud Computing and Advanced Computer Networks etc. Candidates who have B. Tech / B. E degree eligible for M.Tech in I.T. Engineering. The average fees for the M.Tech in I.T. Engineering varies between INR 50,000 to 2,00000 per annum.</p>\r\n', 'Pursue postgraduation in Information Technology to specialize in software engineering, cloud computing, data analytics, and cybersecurity. Designed for future I', 'M.Tech information technology, postgraduate IT course, software systems, cloud computing, data analytics, cybersecurity, IT engineering degree, information technology programs, advanced IT studies, best M.Tech in IT', 'Discover the industry visit program at GMIU, designed to provide students with practical exposure to industry trends, innovation, and real-world experiences.', 'M.Tech in Information Technology – Advanced IT & Software Systems', '', 'IT', '', 36, '2', 105000, 55150, 52500, 52850, 55500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-08-23 10:24:15', '2025-06-26 09:12:03', 0, 0),
(365, 'G166', 0, 26, 1, 'LL.B.', 'under-graduation-ll-b-', '', '<p>The LLB Department provides a comprehensive legal education designed to equip students with a&nbsp;thorough understanding of fundamental laws, legal systems, and judicial processes. The program&nbsp;focuses on developing strong analytical, research, and advocacy skills while fostering ethical and&nbsp;professional responsibility. Through a combination of theoretical instruction, practical training, moot&nbsp;courts, and internships, the department prepares students to engage confidently in legal practice, public&nbsp;service, and policy-related fields. With a commitment to academic excellence and social justice, the LLB&nbsp;Department aims to produce competent and principled law graduates ready to contribute meaningfully&nbsp;to society.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The LLB undergraduate program provides foundational knowledge of law, legal systems, and justice while developing analytical, research, and advocacy skills. It prepares students for professional legal&nbsp;practice and further specialized studies.</p>\r\n', 'Discover GMIUs program offerings in the Faculty of Management, designed to prepare students for leadership roles in the business world with practical skills.', 'LL.B degree, bachelor of law, undergraduate law course, legal education, law colleges in India, criminal law, constitutional law, civil procedure, legal studies, law programs India', '', 'LL.B. Undergraduate Program - Gyanmanjari Innovative University | GMIU', '', '', '', 60, '3', 46500, 25900, 23250, 23600, 23250, 23600, 26250, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 0, '2024-08-30 07:53:51', '2025-12-12 05:47:33', 0, 0),
(366, '', 0, 16, 6, 'CGI for Films and Advertising', 'certificate-course-cgi-for-films-and-advertising', '', '<ul>\r\n	<li>modeling and texturing</li>\r\n	<li>lighting</li>\r\n	<li>scene setup</li>\r\n	<li>tracking</li>\r\n	<li>matchmoving</li>\r\n	<li>compositing</li>\r\n	<li>color grade and final result</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 15, '6 Months', 60000, 22500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-11-13 07:20:26', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
(367, '', 0, 16, 6, 'Advance in Animation', 'certificate-course-advance-in-animation', '', '<ul>\r\n	<li>basics of animation</li>\r\n	<li>body-mechanics</li>\r\n	<li>Dynamic action and combat</li>\r\n	<li>Introduce to acting</li>\r\n	<li>advance acting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 15, '6 Months', 60000, 22500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, 0, '2024-11-13 07:22:07', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', 0, 0),
