(573, 'G42', 0, 2, 2, 'pharmaceutics', 'post-graduation-pharmaceutics', '', '<p>The&nbsp; Master of Pharmacy (M.Pharm) is a postgraduate degree focusing on advanced pharmaceutical sciences, typically pursued after completing a Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm). The program usually spans two years and is designed to provide in-depth knowledge in specific areas of pharmacy, preparing students for careers in research, academia, industry, and healthcare.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Core Objectives:</strong><br />\r\n- Deepen understanding of pharmaceutical science and research.<br />\r\n- Develop specialized knowledge in areas like pharmaceutics, pharmacology, pharmaceutical chemistry, or quality assurance.<br />\r\n- Train students in advanced laboratory techniques, drug development, formulation, and quality control.<br />\r\n- Foster analytical, research, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specializations:</strong><br />\r\n<strong>1. Pharmaceutics</strong>: Focus on the formulation and development of drugs.<br />\r\n<strong>2. Pharmaceutical Quality Assurance:</strong> Emphasizes quality control, regulations, and standards in pharmaceutical production.<br />\r\nCourse Structure:<br />\r\n- Year 1 ( Semester-1 and 2) : Theoretical coursework combined with laboratory work, focusing on specialized subjects depending on the chosen field.<br />\r\n- Year 2 (Semester-3 and 4) : Research project or dissertation work where students apply their learning to practical research problems.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Career Opportunities:</strong><br />\r\nGraduates can pursue roles in:<br />\r\n- Pharmaceutical Industry: Formulation scientist, quality control, regulatory affairs.<br />\r\n- Research and Development: Engaged in drug development and formulation.<br />\r\n- Academia: Teaching and research positions in universities or colleges.<br />\r\n- Healthcare: Clinical pharmacist or hospital pharmacist roles.</p>\r\n', 'Advance your pharmaceutical career with an M.Pharm in Pharmaceutics. Gain expertise in drug formulation, delivery systems, and pharmaceutical research.', 'M.Pharm pharmaceutics, postgraduate pharmacy course, drug formulation, pharmaceutical research, pharmacy college, pharmaceutical technology, best M.Pharm program', '', 'M.Pharm in Pharmaceutics – Institute of Pharmacy', '', '', '', 18, '2', 117000, 64075, 61425, 61775, 64425, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-23 06:01:49', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(574, 'G153', 0, 8, 1, 'BCA Hon. In Gaming Technology', 'under-graduation-bca-hon-in-gaming-technology', '', '', 'Build your career in game development with a BCA Hon. in Gaming Technology. Learn game design, 3D animation, and interactive programming.', 'BCA gaming technology, game development course, game programming, 3D animation, gaming degree, computer applications, best gaming college, interactive media', '', 'BCA Honours in Gaming Technology – Institute of Computer Applications', '', '', '', 30, '4', 53800, 31150, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 31750, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 0, 0, '2025-01-27 06:08:48', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(575, 'G24', 0, 1, 5, 'Computer Science and Engineering', 'diploma-computer-science-and-engineering', '', '<p>The Department Computer Engineering of GMIU offers Computer Science Engineering (CSE) is an academic programme that integrates the field of&nbsp;Computer Engineering and Computer Science. It is one of the most sought-after courses among engineering students. The course contains a plethora of topics but emphasises the basics of computer programming and networking. The topics covered in the course are computation, algorithms, programming languages, program design, computer software, computer hardware and others. Computer science engineers are involved in many aspects of computing, from the design of individual microprocessors, personal computers, and supercomputers to circuit designing and writing software that powers them. Many technical institutes in India and abroad offer UG (Undergraduate) and PG (Postgraduate) level courses in Computer Science Engineering. Students can do BTech and MTech in Computer Science Engineering from these institutes. Students pursuing these courses get to learn about the design, implementation and management of information systems of computer hardware and software.</p>\r\n', 'Get hands-on training in software, hardware, and networking with our Diploma in Computer Science and Engineering. Build your tech career early.', 'diploma computer science, diploma CSE, software engineering, computer engineering diploma, early tech career, IET courses, polytechnic engineering', '', 'Diploma in Computer Science and Engineering – IET', '', '', '', 60, '3', 58000, 31300, 29000, 29350, 29000, 29350, 32000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-27 06:31:51', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(576, 'G112', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon. In English', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-english', '', '<p>Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.</p>\r\n', 'Explore literature, linguistics, and critical thinking with a BA Honours in English. A strong foundation for media, teaching, and public service careers.', 'BA English honours, English literature course, language and literature, girls college arts, English studies, humanities degree', '', 'BA Honours in English – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', 'BA Eng.', '6', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:35:03', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(577, 'G114', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon.  In Psychology', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-psychology', '', '<p>Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.</p>\r\n', 'Understand human behavior with a BA Honours in Psychology. Learn cognitive, social, and clinical psychology in a practical and inclusive setting.', 'psychology degree, BA psychology, women’s college, behavioral science, mental health education, undergraduate psychology course', '', 'BA Honours in Psychology – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', 'BA PSY.', '6', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:40:06', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(578, 'G119', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon.  In Sociology', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-sociology', '', '<p>Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.</p>\r\n', 'Study society, culture, and social systems through a BA Honours in Sociology. Prepare for careers in social research, NGOs, and civil services.', 'sociology degree, BA sociology, social science, culture and society, women’s college courses, social work foundation, humanities', '', 'BA Honours in Sociology – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:40:54', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL);
