(579, 'G123', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon. In Economics', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-economics', '', '<p>Arts degree helps Graduates to develop their soft skills and provide scope for better career options. Incorporation of such subjects will give opportunities to the students for future government job and career in good corporate company and also in international field. Training in such subjects makes the student proficient for international field.</p>\r\n', 'Analyze markets, policy, and development with a BA Honours in Economics. Perfect for aspiring economists, analysts, or public sector professionals.', 'economics degree, BA economics, development economics, policy studies, women’s education, social science, economic analysis', '', 'BA Honours in Economics – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:41:51', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(580, 'G129', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in English', 'post-graduation-ma-in-english', '', '<p>Our Master of Arts in English program offers a dynamic and immersive exploration of the vast literary landscape. Beyond deepening your understanding of canonical works, this program delves into contemporary literary theories and critical perspectives, fostering a nuanced approach to literary analysis. With a focus on research, writing, and critical thinking skills, you&#39;ll engage with diverse genres and cultures, preparing you for a range of professional paths. This program not only enriches your literary knowledge but also cultivates the analytical and communication skills essential for success in academia, publishing, writing, and beyond. Join us in a vibrant intellectual community that celebrates the power of language and literature to shape and reflect the world around us.</p>\r\n', 'Deepen your knowledge of English literature, criticism, and communication with a Master’s in English. Ideal for teaching, research, and media.', 'MA English, postgraduate English, literature studies, girls PG college, English literature, master of arts in English', '', 'MA in English – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:43:27', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(581, 'G143', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Mass Communication and Journalism', 'post-graduation-ma-in-mass-communication-and-journalism', '', '<p>Degree in Mass Communication and Journalism is more than just media studies; it&#39;s a training ground for effective communicators. Graduates not only master media skills but also develop soft skills crucial for success in the fast-paced world of journalism, public relations, and corporate communication.</p>\r\n', 'Excel in media, public relations, and digital storytelling with an MA in Mass Communication and Journalism. Learn reporting, editing, and production.', 'journalism MA, mass communication degree, media studies, PR course, girls media program, news and communication, media master’s', '', 'MA in Mass Communication & Journalism – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 56800, 32500, 29850, 30200, 32850, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:45:34', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(582, 'G137', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Sociology', 'post-graduation-ma-in-sociology', '', '<p>Degree in Sociology delves into the complexities of society, shaping graduates into perceptive analysts of human dynamics. This degree not only provides academic expertise but also nurtures soft skills essential for navigating diverse professional landscapes, from community development to international organizations.</p>\r\n', 'MA sociology, postgraduate sociology, social theory, women’s PG college, social research, civil services foundation', 'Advance your understanding of social issues, communities, and research with an MA in Sociology. Ideal for careers in teaching, NGOs, and policy.', '', 'MA in Sociology – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:46:34', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(583, 'G131', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Psychology', 'post-graduation-ma-in-psychology', '', '<p>Degree in Psychology nurtures a deep understanding of the human psyche. Graduates not only develop profound insights into human behavior but also cultivate essential soft skills. This degree opens doors to diverse career paths, offering opportunities in both the corporate world and international arenas.</p>\r\n', 'Build a career in mental health, counseling, or academia with an MA in Psychology. Includes clinical and applied psychology training.', 'MA psychology, clinical psychology, postgraduate psychology course, women’s education, mental health careers, counseling studies', '', 'MA in Psychology – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:51:41', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(584, '', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Economics', 'post-graduation-ma-in-economics', '', '<p>Degree in Economics goes beyond numbers; it hones critical thinking and problem-solving skills. Graduates are well-equipped for varied careers, not only in the corporate sector but also in government services and international organizations, making them valuable contributors to the global economy.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 0, 0, '2025-01-28 09:52:25', '2025-06-11 05:33:12', NULL, NULL),
(585, 'G135', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Economics', 'post-graduation-ma-in-economics', '', '<p>Degree in Economics goes beyond numbers; it hones critical thinking and problem-solving skills. Graduates are well-equipped for varied careers, not only in the corporate sector but also in government services and international organizations, making them valuable contributors to the global economy.</p>\r\n', 'Strengthen your analytical and policy-making skills with an MA in Economics. Prepare for careers in research, finance, and government.', 'MA economics, economics postgraduate degree, economic analysis, public policy, research and finance, women’s PG programs', '', 'MA in Economics – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 09:53:30', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(586, 'G141', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Political Science', 'post-graduation-ma-in-political-science', '', '<p>Degree in Political Science grooms graduates for roles beyond politics. This degree not only imparts knowledge about governance but also hones communication and analytical skills. Graduates are well-prepared for careers in public service, corporate sectors, and international relations.</p>\r\n', 'Understand governance, political systems, and global affairs with an MA in Political Science. Ideal for academics and civil service aspirants.', 'MA political science, government studies, civil services preparation, politics and policy, postgraduate humanities, women’s education', '', 'MA in Political Science – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:06:15', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(587, 'G145', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in Public Administration (Civil Services)', 'post-graduation-ma-in-public-administration-civil-services', '', '<p>Degree in Public Administration shapes graduates into ethical leaders. This degree not only imparts knowledge about governance but also hones organizational and leadership skills. Graduates are prepared for impactful roles in civil services, public policy, and international relations.</p>\r\n', 'Build a strong foundation for civil services with an MA in Public Administration. Study governance, public policy, and administrative processes.', 'MA public administration, civil services MA, governance studies, public policy course, UPSC preparation, PG for women', '', 'MA in Public Administration – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 56800, 32500, 29850, 30200, 32850, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:07:10', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(588, 'G125', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon. in Mass Communication and Journalism', 'post-graduation-ba-hon-in-mass-communication-and-journalism', '', '<p>Degree in Mass Communication and Journalism is more than just media studies; it&#39;s a training ground for effective communicators. Graduates not only master media skills but also develop soft skills crucial for success in the fast-paced world of journalism, public relations, and corporate communication.</p>\r\n', 'Start a dynamic media career with a BA Hon. in Mass Communication & Journalism. Gain skills in writing, broadcasting, and digital media.', 'BA mass communication, journalism degree, media studies, women’s journalism course, digital storytelling, news writing', '', 'BA Honours in Mass Communication & Journalism – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 49800, 28550, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 29150, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:08:41', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(589, 'G127', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon. in Public Administration (Civil Services)', 'post-graduation-ba-hon-in-public-administration-civil-services', '', '<p>Degree in Public Administration shapes graduates into ethical leaders. This degree not only imparts knowledge about governance but also hones organizational and leadership skills. Graduates are prepared for impactful roles in civil services, public policy, and international relations.</p>\r\n', 'Prepare for UPSC and other public sector exams with a BA Hon. in Public Administration. Learn administrative theory and governance principles.', 'BA public administration, UPSC foundation, civil services degree, women’s public admin course, Indian governance studies', '', 'BA Honours in Public Administration – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 49800, 28550, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 29150, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:09:58', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(590, 'G117', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon in. Gujarati', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-gujarati', '', '<p>Degree in Gujarati is more than a linguistic exploration; it&#39;s a celebration of culture. This degree fosters a rich appreciation for Gujarati literature and language, providing graduates with not just academic knowledge but also the soft skills required for success in various professional domains, both locally and internationally.</p>\r\n', 'Celebrate regional language and literature with a BA Hon. in Gujarati. Suitable for careers in teaching, translation, and media.', 'BA Gujarati, regional language course, Gujarati literature, language studies, Gujarati honours, women’s college Gujarat', '', 'BA Honours in Gujarati – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:11:15', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(591, 'G121', 0, 27, 1, 'BA Hon in. History', 'under-graduation-ba-hon-in-history', '', '<p>Degree in History is a journey through time that fosters critical thinking. Graduates don&#39;t just acquire historical knowledge; they develop the soft skills necessary for effective communication and analysis. This degree opens doors to careers in various sectors, including education, research, and cultural heritage.</p>\r\n', 'Explore civilizations, historical events, and heritage with a BA Hon. in History. Ideal for teaching, research, and competitive exams.', 'BA history, history degree, historical studies, civil services base, heritage studies, women’s education', '', 'BA Honours in History – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:12:01', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(592, 'G133', 0, 27, 2, 'MA Hon in. Gujarati', 'post-graduation-ma-hon-in-gujarati', '', '<p>Degree in Gujarati is more than a linguistic exploration; it&#39;s a celebration of culture. This degree fosters a rich appreciation for Gujarati literature and language, providing graduates with not just academic knowledge but also the soft skills required for success in various professional domains, both locally and internationally.</p>\r\n', 'Deepen your literary and linguistic knowledge with an MA Hon. in Gujarati. Perfect for teaching, publishing, or cultural research careers.', 'MA Gujarati, Gujarati literature, language and culture, women’s PG course, Gujarati studies, regional language MA', '', 'MA Honours in Gujarati – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '6', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:15:12', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(593, 'G139', 0, 27, 2, 'MA in. History', 'post-graduation-ma-in-history', '', '<p>Degree in History is a journey through time that fosters critical thinking. Graduates don&#39;t just acquire historical knowledge; they develop the soft skills necessary for effective communication and analysis. This degree opens doors to careers in various sectors, including education, research, and cultural heritage.</p>\r\n', 'Study historical research, chronology, and historiography with an MA in History. Great for academic and civil service pathways.', 'MA history, postgraduate history, historical analysis, civil service preparation, research in history, humanities PG', '', 'MA in History – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:15:50', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(594, '', 0, 27, 1, 'Corporate Financial Management', 'under-graduation-corporate-financial-management', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '4', 79000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 0, 0, '2025-01-28 10:18:42', '2025-06-09 04:38:06', NULL, NULL),
(595, '', 0, 27, 2, 'M.Com Statistics', 'post-graduation-m-com-statistics', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects.In M.COM there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course. It is an advanced level of systematic study that is focused on statistics topics.An M.Com Statistics deals primarily with data analysis and interpretation and those who do this course will acquire the complete knowledge set of how to analyse data, which models to build, which tests to run, how to interpret it and finally, the practical applications for companies and governments alike Anyone pursuing this course will definitely develop the most important skill of analysis and logical reasoning. Other skills like data interpretation, critical reasoning, the ability to recognize patterns in a large set of data, testing appropriateness of parameters etc will automatically come as a part of the course After completion of this course, a candidate will not only be eligible for a job in the banking and finance sector, but can also pursue professorship or join a consulting firm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 0, 0, '2025-01-28 10:19:39', '2025-06-11 05:33:12', NULL, NULL),
(596, 'G73', 0, 27, 1, 'B.Com Hon. in Finance and Accounting', 'under-graduation-b-com-hon-in-finance-and-accounting', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.</p>\r\n', 'Build strong financial expertise with B.Com Hon. in Finance & Accounting. Ideal for careers in CA, CFA, banking, and corporate finance.', 'B.Com finance, accounting degree, commerce honors, financial studies, CA preparation, women’s commerce college', '', 'B.Com Honours in Finance & Accounting – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', 'B.Com FC', '4', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:20:39', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(597, 'G75', 0, 27, 1, 'B.Com Hon. in Banking &amp; Insurance', 'under-graduation-b-com-hon-in-banking-amp-insurance', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.</p>\r\n', 'Gain specialized knowledge in financial institutions with B.Com Hon. in Banking & Insurance. Ideal for BFSI sector careers.', 'B.Com banking, insurance studies, commerce honors, BFSI course, finance and risk management', '', 'B.Com Honours in Banking & Insurance – Gyanmanjari Girls CollegE', '', '', '', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:21:23', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(598, 'G77', 0, 27, 1, 'B.Com Hon. in Marketing &amp; Management', 'under-graduation-b-com-hon-in-marketing-amp-management', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.</p>\r\n', 'Learn core business strategies with B.Com Hon. in Marketing & Management. Designed for careers in sales, branding, and corporate growth.', 'B.Com marketing, management degree, business studies, commerce course, branding and strategy', '', 'B.Com Honours in Marketing & Management – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 60, '4', 30400, 18400, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 16000, 16350, 19000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:22:01', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(599, 'G82', 0, 27, 2, 'M.Com Finance and Accounting', 'post-graduation-m-com-finance-and-accounting', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.</p>\r\n', 'Turn ideas into ventures with B.Com Hon. in Innovation & Startup. Learn entrepreneurship, business models, and market strategies.', 'B.Com innovation, entrepreneurship degree, startup course, business model education, women entrepreneurs', '', 'B.Com Honours in Innovation & Startup – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:22:42', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(600, 'G84', 0, 27, 2, 'M.Com Banking &amp; Insurance', 'post-graduation-m-com-banking-amp-insurance', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses amongGraduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. It is an advanced level of systematic study that is focused on Banking and insurance.A Banking, Finance, and Insurance course would typically focus on the principles and practices of the financial industry, such as banking, investing, insurance, and risk management. These classes are intended to give students a firm foundation in financial principles and practices. Students study various financial markets, such as stock markets, bond markets, commodity markets, and currency markets. They investigate how these markets function, particularly the trading and price systems.</p>\r\n', 'Advance your financial acumen with M.Com in Finance & Accounting. Ideal for corporate roles, audits, and public finance.', 'M.Com finance, accounting PG, postgraduate commerce, financial control, auditing and accounts', '', 'M.Com in Finance & Accounting – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:23:37', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(601, 'G88', 0, 27, 2, 'M. Com Innovation and Business', 'post-graduation-m-com-innovation-and-business', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. It is an advanced level of systematic study that is focused on Innovation and bussiness topics.In M.COM there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course. Business innovation is an organization&#39;s process for introducing new ideas, workflows, methodologies, services or products. Innovation often begins with idea generation, wherein ideas are narrowed down during brainstorming sessions, after which leaders consider the business viability, feasibility and desirability of each idea. Business innovation should improve on existing products, services or processes, solve a problem or reach new customers.</p>\r\n', 'Specialize in risk and finance with M.Com in Banking & Insurance. Prepares students for BFSI jobs and certifications.', 'M.Com banking, insurance postgraduate, BFSI education, financial sector degree', '', 'M.Com in Banking & Insurance – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '4', 30, '2', 56800, 32500, 29850, 30200, 32850, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:24:38', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(602, 'G86', 0, 27, 2, 'M.Com Marketing &amp; Management', 'post-graduation-m-com-marketing-amp-management', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects.In M.COM there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course. It is an advanced level of systematic study that is focused on Marketing and Management topics. Marketing management refers to the strategies, tools and analyses used in promoting a business. Businesses use marketing management techniques to identify opportunities for growth and connect effectively with new target markets. It coordinates advertising efforts across platforms to promote a brand&rsquo;s image and capture as many potential customers as possible.</p>\r\n', 'Master the tools of innovation and business development with M.Com in Innovation & Business. Great for startups and intrapreneurship.', 'M.Com business innovation, entrepreneurship PG, startup management, innovation studies', '', 'M.Com in Innovation & Business – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 30, '2', 32500, 19900, 17250, 17600, 20250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:26:27', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(603, 'G79', 0, 27, 1, 'B.com Honor In Innovation &amp; Startup', 'under-graduation-b-com-honor-in-innovation-amp-startup', '', '<p>Commerce study is one of the most popular courses among Graduates and post graduate. Those who want to gain in-depth knowledge in commerce stream can study B.Com and M.Com. Commerce courses are designed to provide knowledge in specific subjects. A typical Commerce course in the Field of Commerce focuses on an overview of all subjects under the umbrella of the Commerce stream. A large proportion of students who passed in class 12th with B.Com commerce stream are aspiring for chartered accountancy, company secretary ship and cost accounting. After completing the Commerce course, one can go for further courses in Teaching, Advertising, Journalism, Mass Communication, Design, Law etc. In B.Com there are current demand based courses like Finance and Accounting , Banking and Insurance, Marketing and Management. Now more students can join this the course.</p>\r\n', 'Deepen your expertise in branding, consumer behavior, and strategy with M.Com in Marketing & Management.', 'M.Com marketing, business management PG, commerce and strategy, branding education', '', 'M.Com in Marketing & Management – Gyanmanjari Girls College', '', '', '', 60, '4', 49800, 28550, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 26150, 26500, 29150, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-01-28 10:29:05', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(604, 'G05', 0, 1, 1, 'Computer Engineering (Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning)', 'under-graduation-computer-engineering-artificial-intelligence-amp-machine-learning', '', '', 'Learn intelligent computing with a specialization in Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning. Build future-ready tech skills.', 'AI & ML engineering, computer engineering, artificial intelligence degree, machine learning UG', '', 'Computer Engineering (AI & ML) – Institute of Engineering & Technology', '', '', '', 60, '4', 101000, 52900, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 53500, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:01:00', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(605, 'G07', 0, 1, 1, 'Computer Science and Engineering (Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning)', 'under-graduation-computer-science-and-engineering-artificial-intelligence-amp-machine-learning', '', '', 'Develop AI-powered systems and algorithms with CSE in AI & ML. A cutting-edge program for future data scientists and developers.', 'CSE AI ML, machine learning UG, computer science AI, AI software engineering', '', 'CSE with AI & ML – Institute of Engineering & Technology', '', '', '', 60, '4', 101000, 52900, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 53500, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:01:58', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(606, 'G08', 0, 1, 1, 'Computer Science and Engineering (Cyber Security)', 'under-graduation-computer-science-and-engineering-cyber-security', '', '', 'Enroll in the B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering with specialization in Cyber Security at the Institute of Engineering & Technology. Equip yourself with', 'B.Tech Cyber Security, Computer Science Engineering, Cybersecurity course, Institute of Engineering & Technology, UG engineering cyber security', '', 'B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (Cyber Security) – Institute of Engineering & Technology', '', '', '', 60, '4', 101000, 52900, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 53500, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:02:38', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(607, 'G11', 0, 1, 1, 'Artificial Intelligence &amp; Data Science', 'under-graduation-artificial-intelligence-amp-data-science', '', '', 'Study B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science at the Institute of Engineering & Technology. Learn AI, machine learning, big data, and analytics to bu', 'B.Tech AI and Data Science, Artificial Intelligence course, Data Science undergraduate, IET engineering programs, machine learning UG', '', 'B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence & Data Science – Institute of Engineering & Technology', '', '', '', 60, '4', 101000, 52900, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 50500, 50850, 53500, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:03:15', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(608, 'H01', 0, 1, 17, 'Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning (CE/IT/CSE)', 'under-graduation-hons-artificial-intelligence-amp-machine-learning-ce-it-cse', '', '', 'Explore B.Tech (Hons) in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning at IET, covering CE, IT, and CSE domains. Advance your skills in deep learning, NLP, and i', 'AI and ML Hons, B.Tech in AI & ML, Honors in AI, Computer Engineering AI, IET tech programs', '', 'B.Tech (Hons) in Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning – IET', '', NULL, '', 30, '2', 5000, 2500, 2500, 2500, 2500, 2500, 2500, 2500, 2500, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2500, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:07:27', '2025-08-11 10:39:40', NULL, NULL),
(609, 'G33', 0, 1, 2, 'Thermal Engineering', 'post-graduation-thermal-engineering', '', '', 'Pursue M.Tech in Thermal Engineering at the Institute of Engineering & Technology. Gain advanced knowledge in heat transfer, fluid dynamics, and energy systems.', 'M.Tech Thermal Engineering, postgraduate thermal program, heat transfer course, energy systems engineering, IET PG program', '', 'M.Tech in Thermal Engineering – Institute of Engineering & Technology', '', '', '', 9, '2', 105000, 55150, 52500, 52850, 55500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 05:24:37', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(610, 'G97', 0, 5, 1, 'BBA Hon. Aviation and Airport Management', 'under-graduation-bba-hon-in-innovations-and-entrepreneurship', '', '', 'Join the BBA (Hons) in Aviation and Airport Management at the Institute of Management. Learn airport operations, airline management, and aviation business strat', 'BBA Aviation Management, Airport Management UG, Aviation business course, Institute of Management BBA, airline management course', '', 'BBA (Hons) in Aviation and Airport Management – Institute of Management', '', '', '', 60, '4', 56100, 30450, 28050, 28400, 28050, 28400, 28050, 28400, 31050, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 09:31:11', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
(611, 'G153', 0, 8, 1, 'BCA Hon. In Gaming Technology', 'under-graduation-bca-hon-in-gaming-technology', '', '', 'Study BCA (Hons) in Gaming Technology at the Institute of Computer Application. Learn game development, animation, AR/VR, and real-time rendering with industry-', 'BCA Gaming Technology, Game Development UG, AR VR course, Gaming degree India, BCA in Game Design', '', 'BCA (Hons) in Gaming Technology – Institute of Computer Application', '', '', '', 60, '4', 57500, 31150, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 28750, 29100, 31750, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6000, 6000, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', 1, 0, '2025-04-03 09:49:52', '2025-06-18 12:05:19', NULL, NULL),
